VALUES
	(3,1,'0000-00-00 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','The name is a bit of a misnomer since I plan to post pictures here only on Mondays, Wednesdays, and Fridays. \n\nThe pictures will all be pictures that I have taken and find interesting. usu','Picture of the Day',0,'','draft','open','open','','','','','0000-00-00 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/potd/index.php//',0,'page','',0),
	(4,1,'2008-02-05 21:13:20','2008-02-06 04:13:20','The name is a bit of a misnomer since I plan to post pictures here only on Mondays, Wednesdays, and Fridays. \r\n\r\nThe pictures will all be pictures that I have taken and find interesting. I\'ll try to include the metadata for all of the photos so you can see what kind of equipment and settings I was using. \r\n\r\nAll of the photos you see here will be available to buy either in print for or as a hi-res JPEG file that you can print or use yourself in any way you want. ','Picture of the Day',0,'','publish','open','open','','picture-of-the-day','','','2008-02-05 21:13:20','2008-02-06 04:13:20','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/potd/index.php/2008/02/picture-of-the-day/',0,'post','',0),
