	(59,1,'2008-04-21 10:55:12','2008-04-21 17:55:12','Unfinished Street','Unfinished Street',0,'','inherit','open','open','','unfinished-street','','','2008-04-21 10:55:12','2008-04-21 17:55:12','',60,'http://www.jason-preston.com/potd/wp-content/uploads/2008/04/unfinished-street.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),
	(60,1,'2008-04-21 10:55:41','2008-04-21 17:55:41','<img style=\"border: 1px solid black;\" src=\'http://www.jason-preston.com/potd/wp-content/uploads/2008/04/unfinished-street.jpg\' alt=\'Unfinished Street\' />\r\n\r\nOne of the streets in Loreto, Mexico. Driving through town was kind of a grab-bag experience.','Unfinished Street',0,'','publish','open','open','','unfinished-street','','','2008-04-21 10:55:41','2008-04-21 17:55:41','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/potd/index.php/2008/04/unfinished-street/',0,'post','',0),
	(61,1,'2008-04-23 13:00:43','2008-04-23 20:00:43','Downtown Seattle Sunset','Downtown Seattle Sunset',0,'','inherit','open','open','','downtown-seattle-sunset','','','2008-04-23 13:00:43','2008-04-23 20:00:43','',62,'http://www.jason-preston.com/potd/wp-content/uploads/2008/04/downtown-sunset.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),
	(62,1,'2008-04-23 13:01:01','2008-04-23 20:01:01','<img style=\"border: 1px solid black;\" title=\"Canon Digital Rebel XTi | f/3.5 | 1/4000s | 1600 | 50mm\" src=\'http://www.jason-preston.com/potd/wp-content/uploads/2008/04/downtown-sunset.jpg\' alt=\'Downtown Seattle Sunset\' />\r\n\r\nI like to take pictures while I\'m driving. You just grab the camera with one hand, point it out the window, and click a whole bunch. Sometimes you end up with some really cool shots, like this one. ','Downtown Sunset',0,'','publish','open','open','','downtown-sunset','','','2008-04-23 13:01:49','2008-04-23 20:01:49','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/potd/index.php/2008/04/downtown-sunset/',0,'post','',0),
