	(64,1,'2008-04-25 14:15:41','2008-04-25 21:15:41','<img style=\"border: 1px solid black;\" title=\"Canon Digital Rebel XTi | f/22 | 1/60s | 800 | 28-105@45mm\" src=\'http://www.jason-preston.com/potd/wp-content/uploads/2008/04/bus-stops-for-obama.jpg\' alt=\'Bus Stops for Obama\' />\r\n\r\n\r\nI saw this today when I was taking the bus downtown. Figured if the bus stops in Seattle support Obama, it\'s a good sign. ','Bus Stops Support Obama',0,'','publish','open','open','','bus-stops-support-obama','','','2008-04-25 14:15:41','2008-04-25 21:15:41','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/potd/index.php/2008/04/bus-stops-support-obama/',0,'post','',0),
