	(58,87,'Jason','xwing@seanet.com','http://','216.231.43.71','2005-08-10 10:18:33','2005-08-10 17:18:33','This is true. I practically stole your words with this post. \r\n\r\nHow about this...I\'ll hire you to make an example commercial for McDonalds that we\'ll put up on jason-preston.com\r\n\r\nYour pay will be...a free meal at McDonalds...',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows; U; Windows NT 5.1; en-US; rv:1.7.10) Gecko/20050716 Firefox/1.0.6','',0,1,NULL,'N'),
