	(275,352,'Corvus','manbytesblog@pjsattic.com','http://blog.pjsattic.com/corvus','68.174.71.169','2005-12-14 12:41:48','2005-12-14 19:41:48','Historically, I have heard, the threat of pain is not the best method of extracting accurate information.',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (compatible; Konqueror/3.5; Linux 2.6.11.4-21.9-smp; X11; i686; en_US) KHTML/3.5.0 (like Gecko)','',0,0,NULL,'N'),
	(276,352,'Jason','xwing@seanet.com','http://','209.91.62.197','2005-12-15 12:31:37','2005-12-15 19:31:37','To be fair, I did say \"useful\" information. I\'m not really sure that accurate information has anything to do with global politics and war ;)',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows; U; Windows NT 5.1; en-US; rv:1.8) Gecko/20051111 Firefox/1.5','',0,1,NULL,'N'),
