	(345,424,'Hillary','Hillary.A.Preston@Dartmouth.edu','','129.170.219.10','2006-01-24 17:00:34','2006-01-25 00:00:34','You should let all those people know about what we\'ve got here.  We have free 74-channel cable as well as 60 channels available online through DarTv so people can watch in class if they feel like it (and don\'t get caught).  As you probably already know, I take full advantage of these things, and yes, it is probably detrimental to getting to know all those wonderful people out there whose life consists of going to frats everynight  to get drunk, but somehow I don\'t really mind that.',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows; U; Windows NT 5.1; en-US; rv:1.8) Gecko/20051111 Firefox/1.5','',0,0,NULL,'N'),
