	(580,508,'Jason','xwing@seanet.com','http://','134.69.172.139','2006-03-08 12:41:54','2006-03-08 19:41:54','PS. The answer seems to be here: http://ts.mcafeehelp.com/faq.asp?frames=1&docid=68717&CategoryId=245&chat\r\n\r\nI coulnd\'t find all the files listed there, and I still have to manually quit a few tasks every time I reboot, but for the most part it\'s gone. ',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows; U; Windows NT 5.1; en-US; rv:1.8.0.1) Gecko/20060111 Firefox/1.5.0.1','',0,1,NULL,'N'),
