	(3536,756,'TJ','ttshionyi@rightmedia.com','','208.49.251.250','2006-07-20 09:35:20','2006-07-20 16:35:20','Thanks for following up on the invite Jason; we\'re glad to have you on board as a beta tester.  \n\nAs always, let me know if you have any negative or positive feedback so we can take the appropriate steps to make RMX Direct into a smooth ad management product.',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows; U; Windows NT 5.1; en-US; rv:1.8.0.4) Gecko/20060508 Firefox/1.5.0.4','',0,0,NULL,'N'),
