	(3777,778,'Ben','badlin@oxy.edu','http://www.adlin.com','69.3.70.88','2006-07-30 20:39:29','2006-07-31 03:39:29','I disagree. In the Sunday Times/PI (I assume that\'s the one you\'re referencing), I also like Foxtrot, Doonesbury, and Non Sequitur pretty consistently. The Duplex and The Boondocks are hit-and-miss.',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; U; PPC Mac OS X; en) AppleWebKit/418.8 (KHTML, like Gecko) Safari/419.3','',0,0,NULL,'N'),
