	(3819,547,'Jeremy','jziskind@ucla.edu','','165.235.122.19','2006-08-09 16:52:14','2006-08-09 23:52:14','How can you cross out \"never be in debt\" or \"never get a divorce\"? You could only say you\'ve done these things once you\'re dead.',0,'1','Mozilla/4.0 (compatible; MSIE 6.0; Windows NT 5.0; .NET CLR 1.1.4322)','',0,0,NULL,'N'),
