	(7192,977,'Disillusioned','disillusionedandbored@yahoo.co.uk','','81.170.112.20','2006-11-30 08:08:34','2006-11-30 15:08:34','If you feel very strongly about this then add a Voluntary Code Free Zone badge to your site.  You can find it <a href=\"http://disillusionedandbored.blogspot.com/2006/11/voluntary-code-free-zone.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">here </a>',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; U; PPC Mac OS X Mach-O; en-US; rv:1.8.1) Gecko/20061113 Camino/1.1a1+','',0,0,NULL,'N'),
