	(8475,1017,'Corvus','manbytesblog@pjsattic.com','http://blog.pjsattic.com/corvus','68.236.44.160','2006-12-26 02:44:06','2006-12-26 09:44:06','X-Mas was the 1970\'s attempt at political correctness. Now replaced, of course, by a simple \"Happy Holidays!\"',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (X11; U; Linux i686; en-US; rv:1.8.1.2pre) Gecko/20061023 SUSE/2.0.0.1-0.1 Firefox/2.0.0.2pre','',0,0,NULL,'N'),
	(8501,1017,'Jason','j@jason-preston.com','http://','71.121.97.153','2006-12-26 09:42:40','2006-12-26 16:42:40','That\'s hilarious! Even better that xmas now equals christmas in my mind, instead of \"generic holiday.\"',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows; U; Windows NT 5.1; en-US; rv:1.8.1.1) Gecko/20061204 Firefox/2.0.0.1','',0,1,NULL,'N'),
	(8835,1022,'Teresa Valdez Klein','tsv02001@alumni.pomona.edu','http://teresacentric.com','71.213.116.41','2006-12-28 23:14:42','2006-12-29 06:14:42','We had this exact same conversation and came to the exact same conclusion at the Sparrow house this Christmas...\n\nHow. Fucking. Weird.',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; U; Intel Mac OS X; en-US; rv:1.8.1.1) Gecko/20061204 Firefox/2.0.0.1','',0,0,NULL,'N'),
	(9681,93,'Online Casino Games List','','http://www.the-baccarat-2134.us/online-casino-games-list.html#','66.98.186.40','2006-12-31 15:19:17','2006-12-31 22:19:17','<strong>Online Casino Games List</strong>\n\nhoneysuckle galled,hexadecimal Porte jeeps fall,marketing thefts Top Backarat http://www.the-baccarat-4.us/top-backarat.html# ',0,'1','','trackback',0,0,NULL,'N'),
	(11057,1026,'Teresa Valdez Klein','tsv02001@alumni.pomona.edu','http://teresacentric.com','24.16.81.138','2007-01-02 12:27:35','2007-01-02 19:27:35','Commenting is nice, but it\'s not a necessary feature of a blog. Of course, I think that any blog that flat-out doesn\'t offer comments should explain why they don\'t and offer another forum for feedback (such as e-mail or trackbacks).\n\nAs I\'m sure you\'re aware, <a href=\"http://www.akismet.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Akismet</a> rocks and is a reason for migrating any blog to Wordpress. It makes comments unbelievably easy to manage, which eliminates the \"we can\'t deal with comment spam\" excuse, even for mega-blogs like Gizmodo and Engadget.',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; U; Intel Mac OS X; en-US; rv:1.8.1.1) Gecko/20061204 Firefox/2.0.0.1','',0,0,NULL,'N'),
	(11102,1026,'Jason','j@jason-preston.com','http://','24.41.60.9','2007-01-03 01:27:53','2007-01-03 08:27:53','Akisment, as I made sure to tell Matt when I met him a few months ago, has been the most useful extension to Wordpress I\'ve ever used. It routinely blocks basically everything. \n\nIt\'s just frustrating to me to find so many barriers to the conversation on some \"blogs,\" ya know?',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows; U; Windows NT 5.1; en-US; rv:1.8.1.1) Gecko/20061204 Firefox/2.0.0.1','',0,1,NULL,'N'),
