	(11431,1038,'Hillary','Hillary.A.Preston@Dartmouth.edu','','129.170.244.51','2007-01-06 19:17:00','2007-01-07 02:17:00','I actually thought the same thing just this afternoon.  I was in the bookstore studying next to the window looking onto the street and I had just gotten some tea from the little cafe when all of a sudden it just started to pour.  It was wonderful.  I just sat there and watched for a while (as I was sipping my tea, of course) and it completely made my day.',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows; U; Windows NT 5.1; en-US; rv:1.8.1.1) Gecko/20061204 Firefox/2.0.0.1','',0,0,NULL,'N'),
	(11450,1035,'Ajay','ajayvideogamer@gmail.com','','71.231.0.165','2007-01-07 00:17:36','2007-01-07 07:17:36','Haha yeah, when I first got my iMac I was also confused that safari didn\'t support tabs. However, I found it in the first few minutes and felt really dumb.\r\nIt is weird that it isn\'t enabled by default though...',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; U; Intel Mac OS X; en) AppleWebKit/418.9.1 (KHTML, like Gecko) NetNewsWire/2.1','',0,0,NULL,'N'),
