	(54984,1277,'Duane','dagumcp@yahoo.com','','129.2.175.74','2007-06-29 14:03:27','2007-06-29 21:03:27','I\'m having a similar problem with only a 60G harddrive. I ran across this post a min ago and will look into the indexing and system restore. Also, I noticed that it asks me to backup the harddrive just about every day, so that may be to blame as well.\r\n\r\nhttp://forums.techguy.org/windows-vista/545460-vista-taking-up-hard-drive.html',0,'1','Mozilla/4.0 (compatible; MSIE 7.0; Windows NT 6.0; SLCC1; .NET CLR 2.0.50727; .NET CLR 3.0.04506)','',0,0,NULL,'N'),
