	(68214,1311,'CZroe','jemmettturner@hotmail.com','','24.181.33.141','2007-07-25 21:15:10','2007-07-26 04:15:10','Actually, the only non-Valve game to be added to STEAM that supports registering the CD-Key and downloading the game without the CD is 2K Games/Humanhead\'s \"Prey.\" This is because a competing service went bankrupt and they had to strike a deal to get STEAM to pick up the old customers.\r\n\r\nIt really saved my butt when I was finally ready to play Prey and I couldn\'t find my disc.',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows; U; Windows NT 5.1; en-US; rv:1.8.1.5) Gecko/20070713 Firefox/2.0.0.5','',0,0,NULL,'N'),
