	(71608,1277,'ETTY','etty_alex@mail.ru','','68.34.112.131','2007-08-01 16:16:56','2007-08-01 23:16:56','Vista backup\'s system everyday... that is why space is decrising...\r\nYou can turn it off. \r\nRight click on My Computer -&gt; Properties -&gt; System Protection (click Continue) -&gt; uncheck the automatic restore...',0,'1','Mozilla/4.0 (compatible; MSIE 7.0; Windows NT 6.0; SLCC1; .NET CLR 2.0.50727; .NET CLR 3.0.04506; .NET CLR 1.1.4322)','',0,0,NULL,'N'),
