	(72501,1337,'Jason','j@jason-preston.com','http://','67.160.121.0','2007-08-03 12:03:40','2007-08-03 19:03:40','I know a ton of people prefer <em>Empire Strikes Back</em> over all others, and to be fair, it\'s probably a better movie. But nothing makes me want to eat pizza a drink hot chocolate like <em>Jedi</em>.',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; U; Intel Mac OS X; en-US; rv:1.8.1.6) Gecko/20070725 Firefox/2.0.0.6','',0,1,NULL,'N'),
	(72992,770,'Irene','irene@archetypemarketing.com','http://www.majesticmarketplace.com','71.198.218.60','2007-08-04 11:53:16','2007-08-04 18:53:16','I\'m bummed about what I\'m find out about Bluehost.  I have a very simple pet photo contest running and even  testing the emails myself I get an \"over the number f emails per hour\" error.  I\'ve also had two CPU errors just viewing photos on an internal photo album.\r\n\r\nI purchased a year in advance but because of my clients I may have to just move the big ones to someplace else and eat it.\r\n\r\nDreamhost is one I\'ll check out.\r\n\r\nThis is a bummer.',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows; U; Windows NT 5.1; en-US; rv:1.8.1.6) Gecko/20070725 Firefox/2.0.0.6','',0,0,NULL,'Y'),
	(73087,1352,'Created by: X','createdbyx@createdbyx.com','http://www.createdbyx.com/','207.81.15.166','2007-08-04 16:13:52','2007-08-04 23:13:52','I recently purchased the <a href=\"http://www.steamgames.com/v/index.php?area=package&amp;SubId=440&amp;cc=CA\" rel=\"nofollow\">ID Super pack</a> from steam and had a few problems getting dosbox to stop crashing upon startup and was attempting to edit the config files to no avail.&nbsp; But I now have them working perfectly. Make sure that if you have DEP (data execution prevention) enabled to add an exception for every<a href=\"http://dosbox.sourceforge.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\"> dosbox.exe</a> file for each game. It worked for me and now I can play doom, and commander keen without any problems. people have already started posting similar problems on the steam forums on this issue.',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows; U; Windows NT 6.0; en-US; rv:1.8.1.6) Gecko/20070725 Firefox/2.0.0.6','',0,0,NULL,'Y'),
	(73212,1352,'Jason','j@jason-preston.com','http://','74.211.55.76','2007-08-04 22:45:00','2007-08-05 05:45:00','Thanks for the tip! \r\n\r\nI haven\'t been able to try playing yet since I\'m on vacation and haven\'t really sat down with Steam, but this will definitely save me a headache when I do.',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; U; Intel Mac OS X; en-US; rv:1.8.1.6) Gecko/20070725 Firefox/2.0.0.6','',0,1,NULL,'N'),
