	(1054,1,'2007-01-11 11:35:17','2007-01-11 18:35:17','When you basically live in LA for several years, you forget how cool it is to wake up and look outside your window and see this:\r\n\r\n<img id=\"image1053\" src=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2007/01/snowoutsm.jpg\" alt=\"snow\" />','Snow in the morning',0,'','publish','open','open','','snow-in-the-morning','','','2007-01-11 11:35:17','2007-01-11 18:35:17','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2007/01/11/snow-in-the-morning/',0,'post','',1),
