	(1378,1,'2007-08-13 09:50:27','2007-08-13 16:50:27','I thought I\'d throw up another set of pictures that I took while gallivanting around Rocky Mountain National Park. If anyone wants hi-res versions of these go ahead and shoot me an e-mail. \r\n\r\n<em>Some bighorn sheep just inside the park entrance</em>\r\n<img src=\'http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2007/08/bighorn_web.jpg\' alt=\'bighorn\' />\r\n\r\n<!--more-->This was a picture I took near the top of Flattop, the cloud looked so close you could touch it, and it was skating along the top really really fast. It was much cooler in real life, I think.\r\n<img src=\'http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2007/08/cloud_web.jpg\' alt=\'cloud\' />\r\n\r\n<em>My brother</em>\r\n<img src=\'http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2007/08/conrad_web.jpg\' alt=\'conrad\' />\r\n\r\n<em>My Dad</em>\r\n<img src=\'http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2007/08/dad_web.jpg\' alt=\'dad_web.jpg\' />\r\n\r\nThis flower was all over the place above timberline. Yes, it\'s intentionally a bit out of focus.\r\n<img src=\'http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2007/08/flower_web.jpg\' alt=\'flower\' />\r\n\r\n<em>A hummingbird.</em> These guys are hard to get a good picture of. \r\n<img src=\'http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2007/08/hummingbird_web.jpg\' alt=\'hummingbird\' />\r\n\r\nDon\'t let this fool you. My brother might be taller, but I could still beat the crap out him if I wanted to. Look at how he cowers in fear! ;)\r\n<img src=\'http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2007/08/divide_web.jpg\' alt=\'divide\' />\r\n\r\nThis is currently my desktop background\r\n<img src=\'http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2007/08/mountains_shadows_web.jpg\' alt=\'mountains shadows\' />\r\n\r\nI got a good picture of a Magpie in the grass. The birds our here are practically fearless. \r\n<img src=\'http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2007/08/magpie_web.jpg\' alt=\'magpie\' />\r\n\r\n<em>The Tree of Death</em>\r\n<img src=\'http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2007/08/treeofdeath_web.jpg\' alt=\'tree of death\' />\r\n\r\nAn obligatory set of Long\'s Peak pictures\r\n<img src=\'http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2007/08/long_longs.jpg\' alt=\'long longs\' />\r\n\r\n<img src=\'http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2007/08/another_longs_web.jpg\' alt=\'another longs\' />','Another round of pictures from Estes Park',0,'','publish','open','open','','another-round-of-pictures-from-estes-park','','','2007-08-13 09:53:16','2007-08-13 16:53:16','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2007/08/13/another-round-of-pictures-from-estes-park/',0,'post','',0),
