	(1396,1,'2007-08-14 10:31:03','2007-08-14 17:31:03','I just got my Saturday Pass (pink) to <a href=\"http://www.pennyarcadeexpo.com/\">PAX</a> in the mail today:\r\n\r\n<img src=\'http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2007/08/paxticket.jpg\' alt=\'pax ticket\' />\r\n\r\nI plan on showing up at a groggy 10am and staying the entire day, which I\'m led to believe ends officially a 6pm, and unofficially at 2am when the bars close. \r\n\r\nIf you\'re going to be there, let me know! Love to see people.','Penny Arcade Expo! Will you be there?',0,'','publish','open','open','','penny-arcade-expo-will-you-be-there','','','2007-08-14 10:31:03','2007-08-14 17:31:03','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2007/08/14/penny-arcade-expo-will-you-be-there/',0,'post','',0),
