	(1702,1,'2008-03-02 20:54:12','2008-03-03 03:54:12','Like a brick & mortar storefront, your web site is your face to the public. Practically every purchase, whether it\'s retail, business to business, or service based, is researched online before it is completed. Which means that no matter what your business is, your presence on the web is critical to your success. \n\nI have built websites on multiple platforms for six years. The rise of free web Content Management Systems (CMSs) like WordPress, which is what this site is built on, allow small business to have beautiful, fully functional web sites, with photo galleries, shopping carts, email systems, and practically anything else you can imagine including in a web site... while still providing an easy-to-use \n\n<strong>They way I often work:</strong>\n\n<ol>\n<li>I meet with you or talk to you on the phone about your business and your goals for your web site.</li>\n<li>Based on your goals we set out a plan and a price for the project.</li>\n<li>If you have a mockup or design for me to build to, you deliver that to me.</li>\n<li>You provide the copy and images to be used in your site. If you need me to write the copy or produce the imagery, that will be built into the cost of the project.</li>\n<li>I will build out a prototype of the site and submit it for your feedback.</li>\n<li>Based on your feedback I modify the site.</li>\n<li>Once the site is ready to go, I\'ll teach you how to get in to the back end and make your own changes so you don\'t need a webmaster.</li>\n<li>I\'ll upload the site to the hosting you prefer, and configure it to work with your domain.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<strong>Web Sites I Have Built</strong> (in addition to this one)\n\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"http://tweet-house.com\">Tweet House</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://parnassusgroup.com\">Parnassus Group</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://uigappliedenergetics.com\">UIG Applied Energetics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://l33tsauce.com\">L33tsauce</a></li>\n</ul>','I Can Build Your Web Site',0,'','publish','closed','closed','','web-design-work','','','2011-08-24 13:49:52','2011-08-24 20:49:52','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/the-effects-of-videogame-violence/',0,'page','',0),
	(2620,1,'2011-08-17 15:52:56','2011-08-17 22:52:56','','I Can Build Your Web Site',0,'','inherit','open','closed','','1702-revision-2','','','2011-08-17 15:52:56','2011-08-17 22:52:56','',1702,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2011/08/17/1702-revision-2/',0,'revision','',0),
	(2621,1,'2011-08-18 00:23:59','2011-08-18 07:23:59','Like a brick & mortar storefront, your web site is your face to the public. Practically every purchase, whether it\'s retail, business to business, or service based, is researched online before it is completed. Which means that no matter what your business is, your presence on the web is critical to your success. \n\nI have built websites on multiple platforms for six years. The rise of free web Content Management Systems (CMSs) like WordPress, which is what this site is built on, allow small business to have beautiful, fully functional web sites, with photo galleries, shopping carts, email systems, and practically anything else you can imagine including in a web site... while still providing an easy-to-use \n\n<strong>They way I often work:</strong>\n\n<ol>\n<li>I meet with you or talk to you on the phone about your business and your goals for your web site.</li>\n<li>Based on your goals we set out a plan and a price for the project.</li>\n<li>If you have a mockup or design for me to build to, you deliver that to me.</li>\n<li>You provide the copy and images to be used in your site. If you need me to write the copy or produce the imagery, that will be built into the cost of the project.</li>\n<li>I will build out a prototype of the site and submit it for your feedback.</li>\n<li>Based on your feedback I modify the site.</li>\n<li>Once the site is ready to go, I\'ll teach you how to get in to the back end and make your own changes so you don\'t need a webmaster.</li>\n<li>I\'ll upload the site to the hosting you prefer, and configure it to work with your domain.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<strong>Web Sites I Have Built</strong> (in addition to this one)\n\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"http://tweet-house.com\">Tweet House</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://parnassusgroup.com\">Parnassus Group</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://uigappliedenergetics.com\">UIG Applied Energetics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://l33tsauce.com\">L33tsauce</a></li>\n</ul>','I Can Build Your Web Site',0,'','inherit','open','closed','','1702-autosave','','','2011-08-18 00:23:59','2011-08-18 07:23:59','',1702,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2011/08/17/1702-autosave/',0,'revision','',0),
