	(1708,1,'2008-03-04 17:35:29','2008-03-05 00:35:29','No, I\'m not going to write a big long meaningful post about it. I have little credibility as a Woman or a feminist. \r\n\r\nMy awesome girlfriend, however, has plenty. Go read <a href=\"http://blog.seattlepi.nwsource.com/thebigblog/archives/133430.asp\">her post</a> on The Big Blog. Here\'s a teaser:\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\nBarack Obama was acting as quite the gentleman toward Hillary Clinton in the last couple debates. Right before the debate began, he pulled out her chair and waited for her to sit. When it ended, he got up from his seat, pulled her chair out and waited for her to stand.\r\n\r\nIn one gesture, viewers were reminded of Clinton\'s gender -- an inescapable mark of difference that has played a complex role on the campaign trail and has many American women, like me, wondering what, if anything, her candidacy calls us to do.</blockquote>\r\n\r\n','Women and voting and Hillary Clinton and feminism',0,'','publish','open','open','','women-and-voting-and-hillary-clinton-and-feminism','','','2008-03-04 17:35:29','2008-03-05 00:35:29','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2008/03/04/women-and-voting-and-hillary-clinton-and-feminism/',0,'post','',0),
	(1709,1,'2008-03-05 18:15:32','0000-00-00 00:00:00','<h2>Web Design for regular folks?</h2>\r\n\r\nThanks to the ease blogging, practically everyone is a web designer now. Signing up for a hosted blog on Wordpress.com is a simple matter of filling out a form and checking your e-mail. \r\n\r\nJust like Word Processors have opened the world of typesetting to everyone, blogging has opened the world of web design to the anyone with an internet connection. Like with type, \"God is in the details.\" Learn a few of them, and your site can improve dramatically.\r\n\r\n<h2>Five basic strategies</h2>\r\n\r\nJust like you don\'t have to be an expert to have a web site anymore, you don\'t have to be a design expert to get the look and feel you like. These strategies will help your site look more professional\r\n\r\n<ol><li>Tip one</li>\r\n<li>Tip two</li>\r\n<li>Tip three</li>\r\n<li>Tip four</li>\r\n<li>Tip five</li></ol>\r\n\r\n<h2>More resources</h2>\r\n\r\nIf you\'re looking to get your hands dirty in ways that aren\'t covered here, or if you\'re just interested in the subject, here are some other good resources to get you started. \r\n','Web Design 101: Design Tips for Regular Folks',0,'','draft','open','open','','','','','2008-03-05 18:15:32','2008-03-06 01:15:32','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/',0,'page','',0),
	(1710,1,'2008-03-04 23:59:59','2008-03-05 06:59:59','<ul>\n	<li>@TeteSagehen CPC = robbing the publisher blind. It works in Google b/c they don\'t pay for content creation. <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/3deas3\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://tinyurl.com/3deas3</a> <a href=\"http://twitter.com/jasonp107/statuses/766284928\">#</a></li>\n	<li>@foxywombat congrats dude! Also, seriously, the sheer volume of tweets in my stream today is redonkulous <a href=\"http://twitter.com/jasonp107/statuses/766285347\">#</a></li>\n	<li>@GamerAndy Awesome dude! Hopefully that goes well... <a href=\"http://twitter.com/jasonp107/statuses/766312724\">#</a></li>\n	<li>it would be cool if I could use one Google Reader account to share into multiple shared item feeds. <a href=\"http://twitter.com/jasonp107/statuses/766354145\">#</a></li>\n	<li>no email after 4:30pm today. weird. <a href=\"http://twitter.com/jasonp107/statuses/766430404\">#</a></li>\n	<li>@sernovitz what you mean you\'re not an alien capable of reading 8 million tweets like @scobleizer? <a href=\"http://twitter.com/jasonp107/statuses/766736796\">#</a></li>\n	<li>Strawpoll shows Twitter\'s got a strong Obama contingent <a href=\"http://www.strawpollnow.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.strawpollnow.com/</a> <a href=\"http://twitter.com/jasonp107/statuses/766738243\">#</a></li>\n	<li>@TeteSagehen yeah, there are idiots, bigots, and assholes everywhere. <a href=\"http://twitter.com/jasonp107/statuses/766742061\">#</a></li>\n	<li>Politics of Culture on KCRW today: Are bloggers journalists? streaming live til 3 <a href=\"http://www.kcrw.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.kcrw.com/</a> <a href=\"http://twitter.com/jasonp107/statuses/766751521\">#</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Powered by <a href=\"http://alexking.org/projects/wordpress\">Twitter Tools</a>.</p>','Twitter Updates for 2008-03-04',0,'','publish','open','open','','twitter-updates-for-2008-03-04','','','2008-03-04 23:59:59','2008-03-05 06:59:59','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index