	(1748,1,'2008-03-31 19:25:13','0000-00-00 00:00:00','The more time I spend tinkering with WordPress themes, the more impressed I become with people who have managed to make truly elegant designs come to life. \r\n\r\nThere is a lot of ugliness on the internet, and it ranges from bad typography (not that I\'m a wizard there) to poor page structure and confusing navigation. \r\n\r\nThis list contains, in my opinion, the five WordPress themes that look most elegant right \"out of the box.\" Unzip, install, activate, and you\'re 90% of the way towards having a truly snazzy home on the internet. Some of these themes are free, and some of them you have to pay for. \r\n\r\n<div class=\"biglist\">\r\n<a href=\"http://pearsonified.com/theme/neoclassical/\">Neoclassical Theme</a> by Chris Pearson. Talk about a winner. This is the best free offering from the guy who designed and built the Copyblogger site.\r\n</div>','The 5 most elegant WordPress themes',0,'','draft','open','open','','','','','2008-03-31 19:25:13','2008-04-01 02:25:13','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=1748',0,'post','',0),
	(1749,1,'2008-04-01 11:47:21','2008-04-01 18:47:21','Ever since <a href=\"http://teresacentric.com\">Teresa</a> introduced me to <a href=\"http://www.mamp.info/en/index.php\">MAMP</a> I\'ve become addicted to fiddling with and building WordPress themes on my hard drive. \r\n\r\nIt\'s probably only a matter of time before I start building and releasing my own themes. \r\n\r\nFor now, I\'m working on perfecting a theme I\'ve put together for Eat Sleep Publish. I recently bought eatsleeppublish.com (don\'t bother, it\'s password protected right now) and I plan to spend some time talking to people in the publishing industry about the future of newspapers, books, and magazines. \r\n\r\nI\'m curious about how blogging and new media intersects with classical publishing. And of course I\'m having a lot of fun working on the site design. \r\n\r\nHere\'s a sneak peek:\r\n\r\n<img src=\'http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/04/espsite.png\' alt=\'Eat Sleep Publish\' />\r\n\r\nIf you work in the publishing world and you\'re interesting in talking to me or doing an interview for Eat Sleep Publish, please <a href=\"mailto:jREMOVE@MEjason-preston.com\">let me know</a>. ','Working on new site at Eat Sleep Publish',0,'','publish','open','open','','working-on-new-site-at-eat-sleep-publish','','','2008-04-01 11:47:21','2008-04-01 18:47:21','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2008/04/01/working-on-new-site-at-eat-sleep-publish/',0,'post','',0),
