	(1754,1,'2008-04-04 13:05:37','2008-04-04 20:05:37','Seriously, it\'s so abnormal for Apple. \r\n\r\nI think we should force everyone who coded the interface to use it for all of their e-mail until they fix it. \r\n\r\n<img title=\"The continuum of email user interfaces\" src=\'http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/04/emailui.png\' alt=\'The continuum of email user interfaces\' />','The iPhone placed in the continuum of email user interfaces',0,'','publish','open','open','','the-iphone-placed-in-the-continuum-of-email-user-interfaces','','','2008-04-04 13:05:37','2008-04-04 20:05:37','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2008/04/04/the-iphone-placed-in-the-continuum-of-email-user-interfaces/',0,'post','',0),
	(1755,1,'2008-04-05 12:21:10','2008-04-05 19:21:10','It\'s my brother\'s birthday today, which is without a doubt the best of all possible times to put a ridiculous picture of him on the internet:\r\n\r\n<img src=\'http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/04/conrad_16.jpg\' alt=\'Conrad Preston\' />\r\n\r\nHappy birthday Conrad, you\'re an awesome brother. Much love. \r\n\r\n - Jason','Happy Birthday Conrad',0,'','publish','open','open','','happy-birthday-conrad','','','2008-04-05 12:21:10','2008-04-05 19:21:10','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2008/04/05/happy-birthday-conrad/',0,'post','',0),
