	(1827,1,'2008-09-05 10:14:58','2008-09-05 17:14:58','It\'s funny every time I look at it. \r\n\r\n<img src=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/09/werethedroids-sm.jpg\" alt=\"\" title=\"Those were the droids\" width=\"460\" height=\"311\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-1828 frame\" />\r\n\r\nThose <em>were</em> the droids I was looking for!','The second best image on the internet',0,'','publish','open','open','','the-second-best-image-on-the-internet','','','2008-09-05 10:14:58','2008-09-05 17:14:58','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=1827',0,'post','',0),
