	(1865,1,'2009-01-27 17:45:46','2009-01-28 00:45:46','<img src=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2009/01/wp-shine.jpg\" alt=\"\" title=\"wp-shine\" width=\"433\" height=\"433\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1866 frame\" />\r\n\r\n[ Update: upgrade complete, no hiccups ]\r\n\r\nI am dragging myself, kicking and screaming, into the immediate future. WordPress upgrades often go flawlessly, but if <em>this one</em> doesn\'t, then at least you know why the site looks wonky...','Wordpress upgrade',0,'','publish','open','open','','wordpress-upgrade','','','2009-01-27 18:17:39','2009-01-28 01:17:39','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=1865',0,'post','',1),
