	(1870,1,'2009-01-28 12:58:22','2009-01-28 19:58:22','Actually, all that\'s happening is that the fan is spending a lot, and I mean <em>a lot</em> more time completely spun-up than it used to. I\'m not doing anything particularly new and hardcore with my trusty MacBook Pro, and after all, Geordi La Forge did <a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2009/01/11/it-wont-stay-in-vegas-this-year-either/\">give it a level one diagnostic</a>, so what gives?\r\n\r\nStill, it\'s that dreaded First Sign. You know, the one that tells you \"no, no matter how much you want to think so, this computer is no longer <em>new</em>.\"\r\n\r\nSigh.','My computer whines',0,'','publish','open','open','','my-computer-whines','','\nhttp://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2009/01/11/it-wont-stay-in-vegas-this-year-either/','2009-02-03 00:34:17','2009-02-03 07:34:17','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=1870',0,'post','',2),
