	(1872,1,'2009-01-30 13:29:25','2009-01-30 20:29:25','<img src=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2009/01/inaug.jpg\" alt=\"inaug\" title=\"inaug\" width=\"460\" height=\"307\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1873 frame\" />\r\n\r\nI got my camera back yesterday (by some miracle) and all my photos were actually still on the damn thing. So now I have all my shots from inauguration which I\'ll add to the ones already up on FlickR pretty soon. \r\n\r\nIt\'ll probably happen by the end of this weekend. I would have photos for you sooner but I ran into a slight snag when I nearly destroyed all my backup & existing photo data on my external HDD by trying to partition it so that Time Machine would be actually useful instead of a huge pain the ass. \r\n\r\nAnyways, it\'s a long story. But here\'s a teaser shot to keep you interested while I sort out my data backup woes. ','Inauguration photos are on their way',0,'','publish','open','open','','inauguration-photos-are-on-their-way','','','2009-01-30 13:29:25','2009-01-30 20:29:25','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=1872',0,'post','',0),
