	(1878,1,'2009-02-02 14:38:01','2009-02-02 21:38:01','So says the <a href=\"http://www.nytimes.com/2009/02/01/us/politics/01obama.html?_r=2&hp=&pagewanted=all\">New York Times</a>. My favorite part:\r\n\r\n<blockquote>Mr. Gates does not use e-mail for work, said Geoff Morrell, the Pentagon press secretary, and besides, he sees the president often enough that he does not need it to communicate with him by e-mail.</blockquote>\r\n\r\nI send e-mail to people that I see every single day. It\'s a weird idea to me that someone thinks they could \"not need\" to send e-mail to the President.','Email is the new status symbol?',0,'','publish','open','open','','email-is-the-new-status-symbol','','','2009-02-02 14:38:01','2009-02-02 21:38:01','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=1878',0,'post','',0),
