	(1884,1,'2009-02-05 18:21:40','2009-02-06 01:21:40','All this time I thought that I could sign up for audible.com and it would act like Zune or Rhapsody, and let me download and play as many audiobooks as I\'d like - so long as I pay my monthly fee. \n\nBut it turns out that my monthly fee only gets me one audiobook per month. It\'s cheaper than buying most audiobooks individually, yes, but I\'d rather just keep buying them as-needed from iTunes instead of doing this stupid one-book credit-system. Poo on audible. ','Curses! Audible is not what I want!',0,'','publish','open','open','','curses-audible-is-not-what-i-want','','','2009-02-05 18:21:40','2009-02-06 01:21:40','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2009/02/05/curses-audible-is-not-what-i-want/',0,'post','',1),
