	(1890,1,'2009-02-08 03:51:26','2009-02-08 10:51:26','Gotta love the number of qualifiers in the first sentence of <a href=\"http://www.nytimes.com/2009/02/08/business/yourtaxes/08lede.html?ref=yourtaxes\">this New York Times story</a> about Obama-style taxes:\n\n<blockquote>AT least for the next year or so, nearly every household with an income below $500,000 is likely to get at least a tiny tax cut.</blockquote>','On tax cuts; maybe sorta kinda',0,'','publish','open','open','','on-tax-cuts-maybe-sorta-kinda','','','2009-02-08 03:51:26','2009-02-08 10:51:26','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2009/02/08/on-tax-cuts-maybe-sorta-kinda/',0,'post','',0),
	(1891,1,'2009-02-12 15:38:59','2009-02-12 22:38:59','I know that I\'m really just being whiny and impatient, and if I really wanted it quickly I should have spent the extra $40 and bought it in a physical store, but damnit, I paid for 3-5 day shipping, and we\'re still at least one day out. If I\'m lucky:\r\n\r\n<img src=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2009/02/picture-1.png\" alt=\"tracking-shipment\" title=\"tracking-shipment\" width=\"297\" height=\"262\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1892 frame\" />','So much for 3-5 day shipping (I want my Kodak Zi6)',0,'','publish','open','open','','so-much-for-3-5-day-shipping-i-want-my-kodak-zi6','','','2009-02-12 15:38:59','2009-02-12 22:38:59','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=1891',0,'post','',0),
