eston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-200.jpg\"><img src=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-200.jpg\" alt=\"jp-200\" title=\"jp-200\" width=\"200\" height=\"266\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2061\" /></a>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-large.jpg\">Regular headshot - Large Image</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-200.jpg\">Regular headshot - 200px wide</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-100.jpg\">Regular headshot - 100px wide</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jason-bnw-border.gif\"><img src=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jason-bnw-border.gif\" alt=\"jason-bnw-border\" title=\"jason-bnw-border\" width=\"240\" height=\"297\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2055\" /></a>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jason-bnw-border.gif\">Black & White - 240px wide</a></li>\r\n</ul>','About',0,'','inherit','open','closed','','1810-revision-33','','','2011-05-07 10:05:39','2011-05-07 17:05:39','',1810,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2011/05/07/1810-revision-33/',0,'revision','',0),
	(2508,1,'2010-09-17 18:23:11','2010-09-18 01:23:11','<img src=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jason-bnw-border.gif\" alt=\"jason-bnw-border\" title=\"jason-bnw-border\" width=\"240\" height=\"297\" class=\"alignright size-full wp-image-2055\" /><strong>Jason Preston</strong> is an accomplished public speaker and a recognized expert in both social media and publishing. \r\n\r\nHe has presented for the Web Community Forum, the Redmond Chamber of Commerce, the Greater Seattle Chamber of Commerce, SCORE, the Social Networking for Business Conference, Ignite Seattle, and 140 | The Twitter Conference.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re interested in having Jason speak at your event, please <strong>contact him</strong> via e-mail: \r\n<strong>\r\nj AT jason-preston.com. </strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>Video of Jason\'s work:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n        <li>The Twitter Conference: <a href=\"http://vimeo.com/7148408\">The Comedy Session - Being Funny, In Short</a></li>\r\n	<li>Ignite Seattle: <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dTY9PjrFOhA\">How to Say Anything in 140 Characters or Less</a></li>\r\n	<li>Seattle Chamber: <a href=\"http://vimeo.com/3442553\">Buzz Monitoring in Social Media</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n<a name=\"long\"></a>\r\n<h3>Longer Bio</h3>\r\n\r\nJason Preston is the Vice President of Strategy and Product Development for the <a href=\"http://parnassusgroup.com\">Parnassus Group</a>, a Redmond-based company that produces conferences and parties around emerging technologies, and provides social media intelligence to clients and partners seeking to effectively participate in online communities. \r\n\r\nJason has worked with clients on shaping blogger engagement strategies, creating blogs, and understanding the business value of social media tools like Twitter and Facebook. He has spoken at numerous local and national conferences including the Web Community Forum, The Tweet House, and Ignite Seattle. He has written about social media and emerging technologies in <a href=\"http://crosscut.com\">Crosscut</a> and <a href=\"http://www.seattlebusinessmonthly.com/\">Seattle Business Magazine</a>.\r\n\r\nA lifelong gamer, Jason is the President and co-founder of <a href=\"http://l33tsauce.com\">L33tsauce.com</a>, a videogame site that provides easy-to-use tools for gamers to publish their knowledge in online pages called Dojos. Gamers earn 50% of the ad revenue generated from their Dojos.\r\n\r\nHe graduated from Occidental College in 2007 with a Bachelor\'s degree in Diplomacy and World Affairs, which is a fancy way of saying \"Economics, Business, Politics, and Philosophy.\"\r\n\r\n<a name=\"short\"></a>\r\n<h3>Shorter Bio</h3>\r\n\r\nJason Preston is the Vice President of Strategy and Product Development at the Parnassus Group, a social media intelligence and events production company based in Redmond. Jason has spoken at numerous local and national conferences including the Web Community Forum, The Tweet House, and Ignite Seattle. He has written about social media and emerging technologies in <a href=\"http://crosscut.com\">Crosscut</a> and <a href=\"http://www.seattlebusinessmonthly.com/\">Seattle Business Magazine</a>.\r\n\r\nA lifelong gamer, Jason is the President and co-founder of <a href=\"http://l33tsauce.com\">L33tsauce.com</a>, a videogame site that provides easy-to-use tools for gamers to publish their knowledge in online pages called Dojos. \r\n\r\n<h3>Pictures (right-click to download):</h3>\r\n\r\n<img src=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-widescreen-460.jpg\" alt=\"jp-widescreen-460\" title=\"jp-widescreen-460\" width=\"460\" height=\"114\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2059\" />\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-widescreen-large.jpg\">Widescreen - Large Image</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-widescreen-460.jpg\">Widescreen - 460px wide</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-200.jpg\"><img src=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-200.jpg\" alt=\"jp-200\" title=\"jp-200\" width=\"200\" height=\"266\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2061\" /></a>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-large.jpg\">Regular headshot - Large Image</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-200.jpg\">Regular headshot - 200px wide</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-100.jpg\">Regular headshot - 100px wide</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jason-bnw-border.gif\"><img src=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jason-bnw-border.gif\" alt=\"jason-bnw-border\" title=\"jason-bnw-border\" width=\"240\" height=\"297\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2055\" /></a>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jason-bnw-border.gif\">Black & White - 240px wide</a></li>\r\n</ul>','About',0,'','inherit','open','closed','','1810-revision-25','','','2010-09-17 18:23:11','2010-09-18 01:23:11','',1810,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2010/09/17/1810-revision-25/',0,'revision','',0),
	(2125,1,'2009-09-26 12:37:14','2009-09-26 19:37:14','<img src=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jason-bnw-border.gif\" alt=\"jason-bnw-border\" title=\"jason-bnw-border\" width=\"240\" height=\"297\" class=\"alignright size-full wp-image-2055\" /><strong>Jason Preston</strong> is an accomplished public speaker and a recognized expert in both social media and publishing. \r\n\r\nHe has presented for the Web Community Forum, the Redmond Chamber of Commerce, the Greater Seattle Chamber of Commerce, SCORE, the Social Networking for Business Conference, Ignite Seattle, and The Twitter Conference.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re interested in having Jason speak at your event, please contact him via e-mail: j AT jason-preston.com. \r\n\r\n<strong>Video of Jason\'s work:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Ignite Seattle: <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dTY9PjrFOhA\">How to Say Anything in 140 Characters or Less</a></li>\r\n	<li>Seattle Chamber: <a href=\"http://vimeo.com/3442553\">Buzz Monitoring in Social Media</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n<a name=\"long\"></a>\r\n<h3>Longer Bio</h3>\r\n\r\nJason Preston is the Director of New Media for the <a href=\"http://parnassusgroup.com\">Parnassus Group</a>, a Redmond-based company that provides social media intelligence to clients and partners seeking to effectively participate in online communities. \r\n\r\nJason has worked with clients on shaping blogger engagement strategies, creating blogs, and understanding the business value of social media tools like Twitter and FriendFeed. He has spoken at the <a href=\"http://www.webcommunityforum.com\">Web Community Forum</a>, at <a href=\"http://podcamp.pbwiki.com/PodcampSeattle\">PodCamp Seattle</a>, and at <a href=\"http://igniteseattle.com\">Ignite Seattle</a>. He has been quoted on social media and online communication technologies in the <a href=\"http://www.smh.com.au/\">Sydney Morning Herald</a> and in <a href=\"http://observer.guardian.co.uk/\">The Observer</a>. \r\n\r\nJason is also the founding editor of <a href=\"http://eatsleeppublish.com\">Eat Sleep Publish</a>, a web site that chronicles the changing news industry and the future of publishing. He also chairs a related event series called <a href=\"http://eatsleeppublish.com/the-pitch/\">The Pitch</a>, which brings local community members together to discuss the issues facing publishing companies as they move towards a digital medium.\r\n\r\nHe graduated from Occidental College in 2007 with a Bachelor\'s degree in Diplomacy and World Affairs, which is a fancy way of saying \"Economics, Business, Politics, and Philosophy.\"\r\n\r\n<a name=\"short\"></a>\r\n<h3>Shorter Bio</h3>\r\n\r\nJason Preston is the Director of New Media at the Parnassus Group, a social media intelligence company based in Redmond. He has worked with clients on shaping blogger engagement strategies, creating blogs, and understanding the business value of social media tools like Twitter and FriendFeed. He has spoken about Social Media at the <a href=\"http://www.webcommunityforum.com\">Web Community Forum</a>, <a href=\"http://podcamp.pbwiki.com/PodcampSeattle\">PodCamp Seattle</a>, and <a href=\"http://igniteseattle.com\">Ignite Seattle</a>. He has been quoted on social media and online communication technologies in the <a href=\"http://www.smh.com.au/\">Sydney Morning Herald</a> and in <a href=\"http://observer.guardian.co.uk/\">The Observer</a>. \r\n\r\nJason is also the founding editor of <a href=\"http://eatsleeppublish.com\">Eat Sleep Publish</a>, a blog and event series about the future of publishing. \r\n\r\n<h3>Pictures (right-click to download):</h3>\r\n\r\n<img src=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-widescreen-460.jpg\" alt=\"jp-widescreen-460\" title=\"jp-widescreen-460\" width=\"460\" height=\"114\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2059\" />\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-widescreen-large.jpg\">Widescreen - Large Image</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-widescreen-460.jpg\">Widescreen - 460px wide</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-200.jpg\"><img src=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-200.jpg\" alt=\"jp-200\" title=\"jp-200\" width=\"200\" height=\"266\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2061\" /></a>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-large.jpg\">Regular headshot - Large Image</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-200.jpg\">Regular headshot - 200px wide</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-100.jpg\">Regular headshot - 100px wide</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jason-bnw-border.gif\"><img src=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jason-bnw-border.gif\" alt=\"jason-bnw-border\" title=\"jason-bnw-border\" width=\"240\" height=\"297\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2055\" /></a>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jason-bnw-border.gif\">Black & White - 240px wide</a></li>\r\n</ul>','Speaking',0,'','inherit','closed','open','','1810-revision-15','','','2009-09-26 12:37:14','2009-09-26 19:37:14','',1810,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2009/09/26/1810-revision-15/',0,'revision','',0),
	(2051,1,'2009-03-10 21:41:12','2009-03-11 04:41:12','Jason Preston is the New Media Manager at the <a href=\"http://www.parnassusgroup.com\">Parnassus Group</a>. \r\n\r\nHere\'s a video from a presentation to the Greater Seattle Chamber of Commerce:\r\n<object width=\"400\" height=\"300\"><param name=\"allowfullscreen\" value=\"true\" /><param name=\"allowscriptaccess\" value=\"always\" /><param name=\"movie\" value=\"http://vimeo.com/moogaloop.swf?clip_id=3442553&amp;server=vimeo.com&amp;show_title=1&amp;show_byline=1&amp;show_portrait=0&amp;color=&amp;fullscreen=1\" /><embed src=\"http://vimeo.com/moogaloop.swf?clip_id=3442553&amp;server=vimeo.com&amp;show_title=1&amp;show_byline=1&amp;show_portrait=0&amp;color=&amp;fullscreen=1\" type=\"application/x-shockwave-flash\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" allowscriptaccess=\"always\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\"></embed></object><br /><a href=\"http://vimeo.com/3442553\">Buzz Monitoring: Jason Preston at the Seattle Chamber of Commerce</a> from <a href=\"http://vimeo.com/user1256765\">Jason Preston</a> on <a href=\"http://vimeo.com\">Vimeo</a>.\r\n\r\nJason has worked with clients on shaping blogger engagement strategies, creating blogs, conceptualizing Facebook applications, and has spoken about Social Media at the <a href=\"http://www.webcommunityforum.com\">Web Community Forum</a> and at <a href=\"http://podcamp.pbwiki.com/PodcampSeattle\">PodCamp Seattle</a>. He has been quoted on social media and online communication technologies in the <a href=\"http://www.smh.com.au/\">Sydney Morning Herald</a> and in <a href=\"http://observer.guardian.co.uk/\">The Observer</a>. \r\n\r\nJason is also the founding editor of <a href=\"http://eatsleeppublish.com\">Eat Sleep Publish</a>, a blog and event series about the future of publishing. \r\n\r\nIf you\'re interested in having Jason speak at your event, please contact him <a href=\"mailto:jREMOVE@MEjason-preston.com\">via e-mail</a> (take out the \"REMOVE ME\" in the e-mail addy). ',