le. \r\n\r\nI worry that the health bubble will pop. I don\'t really want to be around for that. ','The health bubble',0,'','inherit','closed','open','','1922-revision-2','','','2009-03-13 11:02:19','2009-03-13 18:02:19','',1922,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2009/03/13/1922-revision-2/',0,'revision','',0),
