 health bubble will pop. I don\'t really want to be around for that. ','The health bubble',0,'','inherit','closed','open','','1922-revision-7','','','2009-03-13 12:13:18','2009-03-13 19:13:18','',1922,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2009/03/13/1922-revision-7/',0,'revision','',0),
