	(1954,1,'2009-03-16 17:45:37','2009-03-17 00:45:37','<p>Fred Wilson shares some comScore numbers on US mobile internet use and US wired internet use:</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote><p>So I\'d assume the total monthly US audience for mobile internet is between 70mm monthly uniques and 80mm monthly uniques.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Given that comScore reports that the \"wired\" internet audience in the US was 192mm monthly uniques, that means that the mobile audience is at least 1/3 and probably a lot closer to 1/2 of the wired internet audience.</p></blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p>I would assume that mobile internet usage is going to continue to grow like crazy. As Fred suggests in his post, designing cloud-based services that are iPhone, Palm, and Blackberry-friendly is going to become a must.</p>','US mobile internet use cotinues growth',0,'<p><a href=\"http://www.avc.com/a_vc/2009/03/in-the-us-mobile-internet-usage-is-at-leasat-onethird-and-maybe-onehalf-of-wired-internet-usage.html\">US mobile internet continues growth</a></p>','publish','closed','open','','us-mobile-internet-use-cotinues-growth','','','2009-03-16 17:45:37','2009-03-17 00:45:37','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=1954',0,'post','',0),
	(1955,1,'2009-03-16 17:44:56','2009-03-17 00:44:56','<p>\n\n<blockquote><p>So I\'d assume the total monthly US audience for mobile internet is between 70mm monthly uniques and 80mm monthly uniques.</p>\n\n<p>Given that comScore reports that the \"wired\" internet audience in the US was 192mm monthly uniques, that means that the mobile audience is at least 1/3 and probably a lot closer to 1/2 of the wired internet audience.</p></blockquote>\n\n<p>I would assume that mobile internet usage is going to continue to grow like crazy. As Fred suggests in his post, designing cloud-based services that are iPhone, Palm, and Blackberry-friendly is going to become a must.</p>','US mobile internet use cotinues growth',0,'<p><a href=\"http://www.avc.com/a_vc/2009/03/in-the-us-mobile-internet-usage-is-at-leasat-onethird-and-maybe-onehalf-of-wired-internet-usage.html\">US mobile internet continues growth</a></p>','inherit','closed','open','','1954-revision','','','2009-03-16 17:44:56','2009-03-17 00:44:56','',1954,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2009/03/16/1954-revision/',0,'revision','',0),
