	(1986,1,'2009-03-25 14:07:13','2009-03-25 21:07:13','\r\n<blockquote>At the same time, the rest of us can\'t afford to demonize every investor or entrepreneur who seeks to make a profit. That drive is what has always fueled our prosperity, and it is what will ultimately get these banks lending and our economy moving once more.</blockquote>','<a href=\"http://www.krnv.com/global/story.asp?S=10067712\">Obama on investors and entrepreneurs</a>',0,'<p><a href=\"http://www.krnv.com/global/story.asp?S=10067712\">Obama on investors and entrepreneurs</a></p>','publish','closed','open','','obama-on-investors-and-entrepreneurs','','','2009-03-25 14:07:13','2009-03-25 21:07:13','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=1986',0,'post','',0),
