	(1995,1,'2009-04-06 11:18:35','2009-04-06 18:18:35','<blockquote>But then we got to thinking that we’re not really all that clever, especially compared to all of you. So we thought it’d be best to throw it open to everyone in the Twitterverse: come up with a better phrase for the back of the T-shirt, win a free seat at the conference. </blockquote>','<a href=\"http://parnassusgroup.com/twitterconference/2009/win-a-free-conference-ticket-the-twitter-conference-t-shirt-challenge/\">Win a free ticket for 140 | The Twitter Conference</a>',0,'<p><a href=\"http://parnassusgroup.com/twitterconference/2009/win-a-free-conference-ticket-the-twitter-conference-t-shirt-challenge/\">Win a free ticket for 140 | The Twitter Conference</a></p>','publish','closed','open','','win-a-free-ticket-for-140-the-twitter-conference','','','2009-04-06 11:18:35','2009-04-06 18:18:35','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=1995',0,'post','',0),
