	(2010,1,'2009-04-11 19:43:42','2009-04-12 02:43:42','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2009/04/09/time-warners-unlimited-bandwidth-plan-150-a-month/\">Strict bandwidth limits from Time Warner</a></div>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>The company introduced a new plan with 100 gigabytes, for $75. Any more than that costs $1 a gigabyte. But there is a $75 cap on the extra fee, meaning unlimited use is capped at $150 a month.\r\n</blockquote>','Strict bandwidth limits from Time Warner',0,'','publish','closed','open','','strict-bandwidth-limits-from-time-warner','','','2009-04-13 19:02:27','2009-04-14 02:02:27','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=2010',0,'post','',0),
