	(2013,1,'2009-04-11 16:36:08','2009-04-11 23:36:08','This page is basically a rolling list of everything I come across that looks cool and that I think I might want.\r\n\r\nI\'ve decided to bold the things that I know I want, and leave everything else in the \"I wouldn\'t mind having this\" category in normal text.\r\n\r\nSo, (friends and family I assume), here\'s the list of everything I think I might want. Naturally, there\'s nothing I particularly need to have, but lists are always helpful.\r\n\r\nAnyways, here goes:\r\n\r\n<h3>The List</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Feel free to get me another year of any of the following addictions: Zune, Netflix, Cell phone, World of Warcraft, or PC Gamer...</li>\r\n	<li>Subscription to Fast Company or Wired</li>\r\n	<li>Clothes</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Running shoes (I like asics)</strong></li>\r\n	<li>USB headset/microphone for the computer?</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Non-jeans (corduroys maybe?) that are length 32</strong> ;)</li>\r\n	<li>The Empress of Mars (book) by Kage Baker</li>\r\n	<li>A record player</li>\r\n	<li>An AppleTV? (It\'s cheaper refurbished)</li>\r\n	<li>A relatively cheap IP-print server</li>\r\n	<li>Set of wireless speakers that can be connected to a standard amp</li>\r\n	<li>Can\'t say I\'d complain about a Nintendo Wii</li>\r\n	<li>A new-generation Kindle</li>\r\n	<li>A wine cooler?</li>\r\n	<li>A cool looking decanter (you know, that thing for scotch with a stopper in the top?)</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Surprises</strong>!</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Wishes for the future</h3>\r\n\r\nThat is, things I want, but that it doesn\'t make sense for me to have now:\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>A nice, comfy leather (or, theoretically, not leather, if it\'s comfy enough) couch that\'s just the right size and shape to sleep on all day.</li>\r\n	<li>Houseplants - maybe fake</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n</ul>','Jason\'s Wish List',0,'','inherit','closed','open','','1998-revision-4','','','2009-04-11 16:36:08','2009-04-11 23:36:08','',1998,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2009/04/11/1998-revision-4/',0,'revision','',0),
