	(2509,1,'2010-12-20 16:22:33','2010-12-20 23:22:33','This page is basically a rolling list of everything I come across that looks cool and that I think I might want.\r\n\r\nI\'ve decided to bold the things that I know I want, and leave everything else in the \"I wouldn\'t mind having this\" category in normal text.\r\n\r\nSo, (friends and family I assume), here\'s the list of everything I think I might want. Naturally, there\'s nothing I particularly need to have, but lists are always helpful.\r\n\r\nAnyways, here goes:\r\n\r\n<h3>The List</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Feel free to get me another year of any of the following addictions: Zune, Netflix, Cell phone, or PC Gamer...</li>\r\n	<li>Subscription to Esquire</li>\r\n	<li>Pants: 32x32 non-jeans, non-courds, non-suit pants.</li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"http://donkeykong.nintendo.com/\">Donkey Kong Country Returns</a> (omfg)</li>\r\n        <li><a href=\"http://www.sonos.com/products/zoneplayers/s5/default.aspx?rdr=true&LangType=1033\">Sonos S5</a> (if you\'re going to get this, let\'s break from the usual routine and talk to me first - I have a <em>30% discount code</em> for this item and will feel totally bad if you pay full price for it. </li>\r\n	<li>Sweaters: maybe one with one of those cool new \"cowl-necks\" and one that comes in a rich navy blue?</li>\r\n        <li>USB CF card reader with no cord, <a href=\"http://www.google.com/products/catalog?hl=en&source=hp&q=usb+cf+card+reader&um=1&ie=UTF-8&cid=5552213667371327134&ei=IeAlS53XGY3UsQPz38ngDg&sa=X&oi=product_catalog_result&ct=image&resnum=2&ved=0CDQQ8gIwAQ#\">like this one</a></li>\r\n	<li>A Network-Attached-Storage device, preferably <a href=\"http://www.tigerdirect.com/applications/SearchTools/item-details.asp?EdpNo=3952307&Sku=D700-2364\">this one</a></li>\r\n	<li>A 500GB SATA 3.5\" HDD to go with it...</li>\r\n	<li>Good books</li>\r\n	<li>A cool looking scotch decanter (you know, that thing for scotch with a stopper in the top?)</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Surprises</strong>!</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Wishes for the future</h3>\r\n\r\nThat is, things I want, but that it doesn\'t make sense for me to have now:\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>A nice, comfy leather (or, theoretically, not leather, if it\'s comfy enough) couch that\'s just the right size and shape to sleep on all day.</li>\r\n	<li>Houseplants - maybe fake</li>\r\n	<li>Set of wireless speakers that can be connected to a standard amp via speaker cable or headphone jack.</li>\r\n</ul>','Jason\'s Wish List',0,'','inherit','open','closed','','1998-revision-25','','','2010-12-20 16:22:33','2010-12-20 23:22:33','',1998,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2010/12/20/1998-revision-25/',0,'revision','',0),
