	(2023,1,'2009-04-14 11:19:30','2009-04-14 18:19:30','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://daringfireball.net/2002/08/iphony\">Early iPhone rumors</a></div>\r\n\r\nIt\'s kind of fun to look at early rumors about the iPhone. This from Daring Fireball in 2002:\r\n\r\n<blockquote>The article seems to insinuate that Apple could make Sherlock run on a cell phone; that’s impossible, unless the cell phone were actually running Mac OS X, which definitely is impossible.</blockquote>\r\n\r\nRemember, of course, that the iPhone was officially announced in January 2007, and a lot about hardware can (and did) change in five years. ','Early iPhone rumors',0,'','publish','closed','open','','early-iphone-rumors','','','2009-04-14 11:19:30','2009-04-14 18:19:30','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=2023',0,'post','',0),
