ww.linkedin.com/profile?viewProfile=&key=7361027\">LinkedIn Profile</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.twitter.com/jasonp107\">Twitter</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://pownce.com/Jasonp107/\">Pownce</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://steamcommunity.com/id/jasonp107/\">Steam</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://biznik.com/members/jason-preston\">Biznik</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\nIf I\'m on anything else, chances are my username is Jasonp107\r\n\r\n','About',0,'','inherit','closed','open','','960-revision','','','2008-09-12 13:45:39','2008-09-12 20:45:39','',960,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2008/09/12/960-revision/',0,'revision','',0),
