	(2045,1,'2009-05-06 14:33:02','2009-05-06 21:33:02','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://online.wsj.com/article/SB124153427633287573.html#\">Pentagon to create \"Cyber Command\"</a></div>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>Later this month, the Pentagon will create a new military \"cyber command\" to coordinate the defense of Pentagon computer networks and improve U.S. offensive capabilities in cyberwarfare. Gen. Alexander, who is expected to lead the new command, said it would ensure the Pentagon was capable of \"evolving to meet and overcome\" cyber threats.</blockquote>\r\n\r\nNow that just <em>sounds</em> cool.','Pentagon to create \"Cyber Command\"',0,'','publish','closed','open','','pentagon-to-create-cyber-command','','','2009-05-06 14:33:02','2009-05-06 21:33:02','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=2045',0,'post','',0),
