	(2049,1,'2009-05-07 10:42:41','2009-05-07 17:42:41','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://www.shacknews.com/onearticle.x/58519\">3D Realms finally kicks the bucket</a></div>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>The closure came about as a result of funding issues, our source explained, with the shut down said to affect both 3D Realms and the recently resurrected Apogee. Employees of both entities have already been let go.</blockquote>\r\n\r\nYou can only live for so long off of Duke Nukem 3D.','3D Realms finally kicks the bucket',0,'','publish','closed','open','','3d-realms-finally-kicks-the-bucket','','','2009-05-07 10:42:41','2009-05-07 17:42:41','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=2049',0,'post','',0),
