click to download):</h3>\r\n','Speaking',0,'','inherit','closed','open','','1810-revision-6','','','2009-05-21 22:12:13','2009-05-22 05:12:13','',1810,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2009/05/21/1810-revision-6/',0,'revision','',0),
