	(2064,1,'2009-05-22 10:31:01','2009-05-22 17:31:01','<img src=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jason-bnw-border.gif\" alt=\"jason-bnw-border\" title=\"jason-bnw-border\" width=\"240\" height=\"297\" class=\"alignright size-full wp-image-2055\" /><strong>Jason Preston</strong> is an accomplished public speaker and a recognized expert in both social media and journalism. \r\n\r\nHe has presented for the Web Community Forum, the Redmond Chamber of Commerce, the Greater Seattle Chamber of Commerce, SCORE, the Social Networking for Business Conference, and Ignite Seattle.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re interested in having Jason speak at your event, please contact him via e-mail: j AT jason-preston.com. \r\n\r\n<strong>Video of Jason\'s work:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Ignite Seattle: <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dTY9PjrFOhA\">How to Say Anything in 140 Characters or Less</a></li>\r\n	<li>Seattle Chamber: <a href=\"http://vimeo.com/3442553\">Buzz Monitoring in Social Media</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n<strong>Upcoming Gigs:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>May 26-27: <a href=\"http://parnassusgroup.com/twitterconference/?jp\">The Twitter Conference</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<a name=\"long\"></a><h3>Longer Bio</h3>\r\n\r\nJason Preston is the Director of New Media for the <a href=\"http://parnassusgroup.com\">Parnassus Group</a>, a Redmond-based company that provides social media intelligence to clients and partners seeking to effectively participate in online communities. \r\n\r\nJason has worked with clients on shaping blogger engagement strategies, creating blogs, and understanding the business value of social media tools like Twitter and FriendFeed. He has spoken about Social Media at the <a href=\"http://www.webcommunityforum.com\">Web Community Forum</a> and at <a href=\"http://podcamp.pbwiki.com/PodcampSeattle\">PodCamp Seattle</a>. He has been quoted on social media and online communication technologies in the <a href=\"http://www.smh.com.au/\">Sydne