	(2105,1,'2009-10-19 14:37:19','2009-10-19 21:37:19','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://www.marco.org/214082853\">In-App Purchase on iPhone will be great for games</a></div>\n\n<blockquote>\"For new apps, there’s now little reason to make separate free and paid versions — it now makes sense in many cases to have what I’ll call a ‘free+’ app until someone else thinks of a better shorthand term: free for a limited or ad-supported version, with in-app purchase for premium features or content. \"</blockquote>\n\nThe iPhone continues to be the best portable gaming platform in existence. Now better for developers who want to actually make money. ','Marco.org - In-App Purchase now available for free apps',0,'','publish','closed','closed','','marco-org-in-app-purchase-now-available-for-free-apps','','','2009-10-19 14:38:41','2009-10-19 21:38:41','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=2105',0,'post','',0),
	(2106,1,'2009-10-19 14:37:19','2009-10-19 21:37:19','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://www.marco.org/214082853\">I see games in this category</a></div>\n\n<blockquote>\"For new apps, there’s now little reason to make separate free and paid versions — it now makes sense in many cases to have what I’ll call a ‘free+’ app until someone else thinks of a better shorthand term: free for a limited or ad-supported version, with in-app purchase for premium features or content. \"</blockquote>\n\nThe iPhone continues to be the best portable gaming platform in existence. Now better for developers who want to actually make money. ','Marco.org - In-App Purchase now available for free apps',0,'','inherit','closed','open','','2105-revision','','','2009-10-19 14:37:19','2009-10-19 21:37:19','',2105,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2009/10/19/2105-revision/',0,'revision','',0),
