	(2157,1,'2009-11-02 16:59:49','2009-11-02 23:59:49','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://seattletimes.nwsource.com/html/localnews/2010183212_dogcarbon02m.html\">A dog\'s eco-footprint is the same as a Hummer</a></div>\n\n<blockquote>a New Zealand study that claims a medium-size dog leaves a larger ecological footprint than an SUV.</blockquote>\n\nGiven the <a href=\"http://www.city-data.com/forum/seattle-area/751021-true-there-more-dogs-than-children.html\">rumored</a> more-dogs-than-children ratio in Seattle, the irony is palpable...\n','A dog\'s eco-footprint is the same as a Hummer',0,'','publish','closed','closed','','a-dogs-eco-footprint-is-the-same-as-a-hummer','','','2009-11-02 16:59:51','2009-11-02 23:59:51','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=2157',0,'post','',0),
