	(2184,1,'2010-01-12 20:29:02','2010-01-13 03:29:02','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://www.techcrunch.com/2010/01/12/iphone-versus-nexus-one/\">An iPhone Lover’s Take On The Nexus One</a></div>\n\n<blockquote>Maybe the hardest thing (or Apple’s greatest strength, depending how you’re looking at it) in using an Android device after being accustomed to the iPhone is the app difference. Simply put, iPhone apps, as a whole, are much, much better than Android apps.</blockquote>\n\nProbably the most informative and useful iPhone/Nexus One review I\'ve seen so far.\n\n','An iPhone Lover’s Take On The Nexus One',0,'','publish','closed','closed','','an-iphone-lover%e2%80%99s-take-on-the-nexus-one','','','2010-01-12 20:29:04','2010-01-13 03:29:04','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=2184',0,'post','',0),
