	(2197,1,'2010-02-01 17:11:03','2010-02-02 00:11:03','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://webpages.milwpc.com/finkjc/silverncastle/\">Silvern Castle</a></div>\n\n<blockquote>ilvern Castle is a fantasy role-playing game (RPG) for the Apple II in the spirit of the classic Wizardry. Unlike Wizardry, which was written in Pascal and proclaimed as a game \"that simply could not have been written in Basic\"; Silvern Castle is almost entirely written in AppleSoft Basic.</blockquote>\n\nIf you have an Apple IIe, this sounds...awesome. \n\n','Silvern Castle',0,'','publish','closed','closed','','silvern-castle','','','2010-02-01 17:11:07','2010-02-02 00:11:07','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=2197',0,'post','',0),
