	(2203,1,'2010-02-03 12:12:36','2010-02-03 19:12:36','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://kotaku.com/5463391/online-multiplayer-assassins-creed-ii-coming-to-the-iphone\">Online Multiplayer Assassin\'s Creed II Coming To The iPhone</a></div>\n\n<blockquote>Coming soon to iTunes, Assassin\'s Creed II: Multiplayer is an online multiplayer game for the iPhone, which uses a Wi-Fi connection to connect you with up to three other players in a game of hide and go die. The goal is simple: kill the other players before they kill you.</blockquote>\n\nI am really enjoying the renaissance of the 1992 videogames industry on the iPhone, but I am still waiting for a good interface for fighting / FPS type games on a pure touchscreen.','Online Multiplayer Assassin\'s Creed II Coming To The iPhone',0,'','publish','closed','closed','','online-multiplayer-assassins-creed-ii-coming-to-the-iphone','','','2010-02-03 12:12:39','2010-02-03 19:12:39','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=2203',0,'post','',0),
	(2204,1,'2010-02-03 12:12:36','2010-02-03 19:12:36','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://kotaku.com/5463391/online-multiplayer-assassins-creed-ii-coming-to-the-iphone\">Online Multiplayer Assassin\'s Creed II Coming To The iPhone</a></div>\n\n<blockquote>Coming soon to iTunes, Assassin\'s Creed II: Multiplayer is an online multiplayer game for the iPhone, which uses a Wi-Fi connection to connect you with up to three other players in a game of hide and go die. The goal is simple: kill the other players before they kill you.</blockquote>\n\nI am really enjoying the renaissance of the 1992 videogames industry on the iPhone, but I am still waiting for a good interface for fighting / FPS type games on a pure touchscreen.','Online Multiplayer Assassin\'s Creed II Coming To The iPhone',0,'','inherit','closed','open','','2203-revision','','','2010-02-03 12:12:36','2010-02-03 19:12:36','',2203,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2010/02/03/2203-revision/',0,'revision','',0),
	(2205,1,'2010-02-03 13:07:16','2010-02-03 20:07:16','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://www.joystiq.com/2010/02/03/even-the-esrb-is-disgusted-with-dead-or-alive-paradise/\">Even the ESRB is disgusted with Dead or Alive Paradise</a></div>\n\n<blockquote>but the game also contains bizarre, misguided notions of what women really want (if given two weeks, paid vacation, island resort)-Paradise cannot mean straddling felled tree trunks in dental-floss thongs.</blockquote>\n\nEven though the ESRB went back and killed the verbiage, this is an awesome ESRB label. \n\n','Even the ESRB is disgusted with Dead or Alive Paradise',0,'','publish','closed','closed','','even-the-esrb-is-disgusted-with-dead-or-alive-paradise','','','2010-02-03 13:07:20','2010-02-03 20:07:20','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=2205',0,'post','',0),
	(2206,1,'2010-02-03 13:07:16','2010-02-03 20:07:16','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://www.joystiq.com/2010/02/03/even-the-esrb-is-disgusted-with-dead-or-alive-paradise/\">Even the ESRB is disgusted with Dead or Alive Paradise</a></div>\n\n<blockquote>but the game also contains bizarre, misguided notions of what women really want (if given two weeks, paid vacation, island resort)-Paradise cannot mean straddling felled tree trunks in dental-floss thongs.</blockquote>\n\nEven though the ESRB went back and killed the verbiage, this is an awesome ESRB label. \n\n','Even the ESRB is disgusted with Dead or Alive Paradise',0,'','inherit','closed','open','','2205-revision','','','2010-02-03 13:07:16','2010-02-03 20:07:16','',2205,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2010/02/03/2205-revision/',0,'revision','',0),
	(2207,1,'2010-02-04 10:40:41','2010-02-04 17:40:41','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://www.nytimes.com/2010/02/04/world/europe/04scotland.html?hp\">For Scots, a Scourge Unleashed by a Bottle</a></div>\n\n<blockquote>“It goes straight to your head,” he said, “but it’s not my cup of tea.” (Mr. Rooney noted that his cup of tea is half a bottle of vodka a night.) </blockquote>\n\nOne of the more memorable lines from a fun news story.','For Scots, a Scourge Unleashed by a Bottle',0,'','publish','closed','closed','','for-scots-a-scourge-unleashed-by-a-bottle','','','2010-02-04 10:40:44','2010-02-04 17:40:44','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=2207',0,'post','',0),
