	(2299,1,'2010-05-10 17:26:38','2010-05-11 00:26:38','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/event.php?eid=115607285139564\">Paparazzi Attack!</a></div>\n\nHooray for Seattle shenanigans:\n\n<blockquote>On May 22nd, we\'re going to be staging a fake sighting of Nick Jonas, the infamous idol of preteen girls. Jonas, sighted while shopping, will quickly be surrounded by camera wielding paparazzi and adoring fans, before he is escorted to his black SUV by his security guards. If we\'re lucky, he might pause to sign a few autographs. And if we\'re very lucky, everyone in the immediate vicinity is going to be totally convinced they\'re in the presence of a real live Jonas Brother. They\'ll never know that this Jonas Brother is really our very own lookalike Asher Jordan. Whatever happens, like always, it\'s sure to be a lot of fun! See you there!</blockquote>\n\n','Paparazzi Attack!',0,'','publish','closed','closed','','paparazzi-attack','','','2010-05-10 17:26:41','2010-05-11 00:26:41','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=2299',0,'post','',0),
