	(2343,1,'2005-07-01 21:45:17','2005-07-02 04:45:17','I thought I\'d leave the subject alone, at any rate...\r\n\r\nJason-Preston.com has undergone a structural change, again. I\'m now running the site under the <a href=\"http://wordpress.org\">Wordpress</a> blog engine, which has been an adventure in itself to set up. Never thought I\'d understand a thing about php, and after setting this up, I still don\'t. \r\n\r\nOne of the reasons I decided to set this up as a second blog (I already have <a href=\"http://www.livejournal.com/~jasonp107\">a livejournal</a>) is that this comes with an RSS feed...quite handy. So if you\'ve got a newsreader or you\'d like to blogroll me, feel free--I won\'t complain. \r\n\r\nOver the next...whatever...I\'ll be fooling with the layout, etc, trying to customize the page and teach myself a little web design. So bear with me if this site is a little in and out for a bit. \r\n\r\n - Jason','Hello world!',0,'','inherit','closed','open','','1-revision','','','2005-07-01 21:45:17','2005-07-02 04:45:17','',1,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2005/07/01/1-revision/',0,'revision','',0),
	(2344,1,'2010-05-14 11:39:31','2010-05-14 18:39:31','<img src=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jason-bnw-border.gif\" alt=\"jason-bnw-border\" title=\"jason-bnw-border\" width=\"240\" height=\"297\" class=\"alignright size-full wp-image-2055\" /><strong>Jason Preston</strong> is an accomplished public speaker and a recognized expert in both social media and publishing. \r\n\r\nHe has presented for the Web Community Forum, the Redmond Chamber of Commerce, the Greater Seattle Chamber of Commerce, SCORE, the Social Networking for Business Conference, Ignite Seattle, and 140 | The Twitter Conference.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re interested in having Jason speak at your event, please contact him via e-mail: j AT jason-preston.com. \r\n\r\n<strong>Video of Jason\'s work:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n        <li>The Twitter Conference: <a href=\"http://vimeo.com/7148408\">The Comedy Session - Being Funny, In Short</a></li>\r\n	<li>Ignite Seattle: <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dTY9PjrFOhA\">How to Say Anything in 140 Characters or Less</a></li>\r\n	<li>Seattle Chamber: <a href=\"http://vimeo.com/3442553\">Buzz Monitoring in Social Media</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n<a name=\"long\"></a>\r\n<h3>Longer Bio</h3>\r\n\r\nJason Preston is the Vice President of Strategy and Product Development for the <a href=\"http://parnassusgroup.com\">Parnassus Group</a>, a Redmond-based company that produces conferences and parties around emerging technologies, and provides social media intelligence to clients and partners seeking to effectively participate in online communities. \r\n\r\nJason has worked with clients on shaping blogger engagement strategies, creating blogs, and understanding the business value of social media tools like Twitter and Facebook. He has spoken at numerous local and national conferences including the Web Community Forum, The Tweet House, and Ignite Seattle. He has written about social media and emerging technologies in <a href=\"http://crosscut.com\">Crosscut</a> and <a href=\"http://www.seattlebusinessmonthly.com/\">Seattle Business Magazine</a>.\r\n\r\nA lifelong gamer, Jason is the President and co-founder of <a href=\"http://l33tsauce.com\">L33tsauce.com</a>, a videogame site that provides easy-to-use tools for gamers to publish their knowledge in online pages called Dojos. Gamers earn 50% of the ad revenue generated from their Dojos.\r\n\r\nHe graduated from Occidental College in 2007 with a Bachelor\'s degree in Diplomacy and World Affairs, which is a fancy way of saying \"Economics, Business, Politics, and Philosophy.\"\r\n\r\n<a name=\"short\"></a>\r\n<h3>Shorter Bio</h3>\r\n\r\nJason Preston is the Vice President of Strategy and Product Development at the Parnassus Group, a social media intelligence and events production company based in Redmond. Jason has spoken at numerous local and national conferences including the Web Community Forum, The Tweet House, and Ignite Seattle. He has written about social media and emerging technologies in <a href=\"http://crosscut.com\">Crosscut</a> and <a href=\"http://www.seattlebusinessmonthly.com/\">Seattle Business Magazine</a>.\r\n\r\nA lifelong gamer, Jason is the President and co-founder of <a href=\"http://l33tsauce.com\">L33tsauce.com</a>, a videogame site that provides easy-to-use tools for gamers to publish their knowledge in online pages called Dojos. \r\n\r\n<h3>Pictures (right-click to download):</h3>\r\n\r\n<img src=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-widescreen-460.jpg\" alt=\"jp-widescreen-460\" title=\"jp-widescreen-460\" width=\"460\" height=\"114\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2059\" />\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-widescreen-large.jpg\">Widescreen - Large Image</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-widescreen-460.jpg\">Widescreen - 460px wide</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-200.jpg\"><img src=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-200.jpg\" alt=\"jp-200\" title=\"jp-200\" width=\"200\" height=\"266\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2061\" /></a>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-large.jpg\">Regular headshot - Large Image</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-200.jpg\">Regular headshot - 200px wide</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-100.jpg\">Regular headshot - 100px wide</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jason-bnw-border.gif\"><img src=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jason-bnw-border.gif\" alt=\"jason-bnw-border\" title=\"jason-bnw-border\" width=\"240\" height=\"297\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2055\" /></a>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jason-bnw-border.gif\">Black & White - 240px wide</a></li>\r\n</ul>','Speaking',0,'','inherit','closed','open','','1810-revision-21','','','2010-05-14 11:39:31','2010-05-14 18:39:31','',1810,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2010/05/14/1810-revision-21/',0,'revision','',0),
