ww.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-200.jpg\"><img src=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-200.jpg\" alt=\"jp-200\" title=\"jp-200\" width=\"200\" height=\"266\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2061\" /></a>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-large.jpg\">Regular headshot - Large Image</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-200.jpg\">Regular headshot - 200px wide</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jp-100.jpg\">Regular headshot - 100px wide</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jason-bnw-border.gif\"><img src=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jason-bnw-border.gif\" alt=\"jason-bnw-border\" title=\"jason-bnw-border\" width=\"240\" height=\"297\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2055\" /></a>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><a href=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jason-bnw-border.gif\">Black & White - 240px wide</a></li>\r\n</ul>','Speaking',0,'','inherit','closed','open','','1810-revision-22','','','2010-05-25 22:46:58','2010-05-26 05:46:58','',1810,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2010/05/25/1810-revision-22/',0,'revision','',0),
	(2346,1,'2010-05-26 11:32:01','2010-05-26 18:32:01','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/news/3872/\">Half-Life 2 Cloud Savegames</a></div>\n\nValve just announced that the Half-Life 2 series is available today on the Mac. Even better, they\'ve enabled \"cloud\" savegames, where you can pick up, on another computer, exactly where you left off - even if you\'ve swapped from a Mac to a PC, or vice-versa. \n\nFrom their Press Release:\n\n<blockquote>The Half-Life 2 titles available now feature cross-platform support for Steam Cloud, allowing players to save their game progress on one computer, then seamlessly resume from that save point on another computer (Mac or PC).</blockquote>\n\n','Half-Life 2 Cloud Savegames',0,'','publish','closed','closed','','half-life-2-cloud-savegames','','','2010-05-26 11:32:05','2010-05-26 18:32:05','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=2346',0,'post','',0),
	(2347,1,'2010-05-26 11:32:01','2010-05-26 18:32:01','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/news/3872/\">Half-Life 2 Cloud Savegames</a></div>\n\nValve just announced that the Half-Life 2 series is available today on the Mac. Even better, they\'ve enabled \"cloud\" savegames, where you can pick up, on another computer, exactly where you left off - even if you\'ve swapped from a Mac to a PC, or vice-versa. \n\nFrom their Press Release:\n\n<blockquote>The Half-Life 2 titles available now feature cross-platform support for Steam Cloud, allowing players to save their game progress on one computer, then seamlessly resume from that save point on another computer (Mac or PC).</blockquote>\n\n','Half-Life 2 Cloud Savegames',0,'','inherit','closed','open','','2346-revision','','','2010-05-26 11:32:01','2010-05-26 18:32:01','',2346,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2010/05/26/2346-revision/',0,'revision','',0),
	(2348,1,'2010-05-27 18:45:05','2010-05-28 01:45:05','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://minimalmac.com/post/637559638/interview-with-diego-petrucci-of-il-mac-minimalista\">Choose your inboxes</a></div>\n\nGreat advice on dealing with incoming messages from Minimal Mac:\n\n<blockquote>I think the first piece of advice is for people to realize that they make the choice on how many “inboxes” to have to a large extent. I think if you make your intentions on how to deal with these well known, up front, people then know what to expect.</blockquote>\n\n','Choose your inboxes',0,'','publish','closed','closed','','choose-your-inboxes','','','2010-05-27 18:45:08','2010-05-28 01:45:08','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=2348',0,'post','',0),
	(2349,1,'2010-05-27 18:45:05','2010-05-28 01:45:05','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://minimalmac.com/post/637559638/interview-with-diego-petrucci-of-il-mac-minimalista\">Choose your inboxes</a></div>\n\nGreat advice on dealing with incoming messages from Minimal Mac:\n\n<blockquote>I think the first piece of advice is for people to realize that they make the choice on how many “inboxes” to have to a large extent. I think if you make your intentions on how to deal with these well known, up front, people then know what to expect.</blockquote>\n\n','Choose your inboxes',0,'','inherit','closed','open','','2348-revision','','','2010-05-27 18:45:05','2010-05-28 01:45:05','',2348,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2010/05/27/2348-revision/',0,'revision','',0),
	(2350,1,'2010-05-27 19:25:33','2010-05-28 02:25:33','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://www.avc.com/a_vc/2010/05/ive-changed-my-mind-about-the-ipad.html\">Less of a commitment</a></div>\n\n<blockquote>The iPad makes using a computer less of a commitment and that has important implications for the way I compute. I like how I feel when I am using the thing.</blockquote>\n\nBingo.','Less of a commitment',0,'','publish','closed','closed','','less-of-a-commitment','','','2010-05-27 19:25:35','2010-05-28 02:25:35','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=2350',0,'post','',0),
