	(2369,1,'2010-06-09 12:40:05','2010-06-09 19:40:05','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://tirania.org/blog/archive/2010/Jun-04.html\">iCoaster - HTML 5 iPhone app</a></div>\n\n<blockquote>I felt that I had to go with HTML 5 as I did not want to write the app once for the iPhone and once for the Android. I am also open sourcing this application in its entirety, to help future generation of mobile HTML 5 developers learn from my experiences and hopefully help them write solid, cross platform mobile applications using HTML 5.</blockquote>\n\nAwesome.','iCoaster - HTML 5 iPhone app',0,'','inherit','closed','open','','2367-revision-2','','','2010-06-09 12:40:05','2010-06-09 19:40:05','',2367,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2010/06/09/2367-revision-2/',0,'revision','',0),
	(2370,1,'2010-06-09 15:24:34','2010-06-09 22:24:34','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://forums.macosxhints.com/archive/index.php/t-17995.html\">How to remove addresses from Mail.app autocomplete</a></div>\n\n<blockquote>In Mail.app, under the \"Window\" menu, select: Previous Recipients. A list of all previous recipients will come up. Those that are already in your address book will have the little Rolodex icon next to them. There are two buttons: 1) Remove From List 2) Add to Address Book</blockquote>\n\n','How to remove addresses from Mail.app autocomplete',0,'','publish','closed','closed','','how-to-remove-addresses-from-mail-app-autocomplete','','','2010-06-09 15:24:37','2010-06-09 22:24:37','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=2370',0,'post','',0),
	(2371,1,'2010-06-09 15:24:34','2010-06-09 22:24:34','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://forums.macosxhints.com/archive/index.php/t-17995.html\">How to remove addresses from Mail.app autocomplete</a></div>\n\n<blockquote>In Mail.app, under the \"Window\" menu, select: Previous Recipients. A list of all previous recipients will come up. Those that are already in your address book will have the little Rolodex icon next to them. There are two buttons: 1) Remove From List 2) Add to Address Book</blockquote>\n\n','How to remove addresses from Mail.app autocomplete',0,'','inherit','closed','open','','2370-revision','','','2010-06-09 15:24:34','2010-06-09 22:24:34','',2370,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2010/06/09/2370-revision/',0,'revision','',0),
