	(2374,1,'2010-06-15 14:51:09','2010-06-15 21:51:09','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://www.thinkwithportals.com/\">Portal 2 Official Site</a></div>\n\nI am loving the new sense of design that seems to have taken over at Valve Software. The new revamp of the Steam interface was gorgeous, and now they\'re popping out beautiful promo art for Portal 2. Love it. Love it. \n\nNow I want my Counter-Strike: Source on Mac ;)\n\n','Portal 2 Official Site',0,'','publish','closed','closed','','portal-2-official-site','','','2010-06-15 14:51:12','2010-06-15 21:51:12','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=2374',0,'post','',0),
