	(2416,1,'2010-09-07 15:00:35','2010-09-07 22:00:35','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://www.jacobtyler.com/creative-blog/2010/09/02/weve-come-a-long-way-in-advertising/\">\"She may be everyone\'s pal\"</a></div>\n\n<blockquote>my partner Charlie forwarded me an email of some classic HORRIBLE ads from back in the Mad Men days (50’s – 60’s). They are SO bad I just have to post them. </blockquote>\n\nThanks @<a href=\"http://twitter.com/Weave/status/23272919740\">weave</a> for the link.\n','\"She may be everyone\'s pal\"',0,'','publish','closed','closed','','she-may-be-everyones-pal','','','2010-09-07 15:00:38','2010-09-07 22:00:38','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=2416',0,'post','',0),
