	(2446,1,'2010-09-27 08:32:58','2010-09-27 15:32:58','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"https://indinero.com/\">inDinero.com</a></div>\n\nIt\'s like Mint.com for business. Kind of an obvious opportunity.\n\n','Easy Business Finance Software, Simplified Small Business Accounting and Cashflow Planning | inDinero.com',0,'','publish','closed','closed','','easy-business-finance-software-simplified-small-business-accounting-and-cashflow-planning-indinero-com','','','2010-09-27 08:33:01','2010-09-27 15:33:01','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=2446',0,'post','',0),
