s</strong>!</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Wishes for the future</h3>\r\n\r\nThat is, things I want, but that it doesn\'t make sense for me to have now:\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>A nice, comfy leather (or, theoretically, not leather, if it\'s comfy enough) couch that\'s just the right size and shape to sleep on all day.</li>\r\n	<li>Houseplants - maybe fake</li>\r\n	<li>Set of wireless speakers that can be connected to a standard amp via speaker cable or headphone jack.</li>\r\n         <li>Queen size mattress and bed frame</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>','Jason\'s Wish List',0,'','inherit','open','closed','','1998-revision-24','','','2010-12-08 13:36:28','2010-12-08 20:36:28','',1998,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2010/12/08/1998-revision-24/',0,'revision','',0),
	(2506,1,'2011-02-16 18:13:03','2011-02-17 01:13:03','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://potluks.com/\">Potluk</a></div>\n\nMy Ruby on Rails side project. It\'s kept me busy for a few months, and is a lot of fun so far. It is a link sharing app designed to make the process of sharing and tracking cool links between friends or teams -- and the conversations around them -- more straightforward. \n\nAny and all feedback is always welcome. \n\n','Potluk',0,'','publish','closed','closed','','potluk','','','2011-02-16 18:13:05','2011-02-17 01:13:05','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=2506',0,'post','',0),
