	(2610,1,'2011-07-19 14:58:28','2011-07-19 21:58:28','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://www.physorg.com/wire-news/72536602/reinventing-the-toilet-for-safe-and-affordable-sanitation.html\">Reinventing the toilet for safe and affordable sanitation</a></div>\n\nA self-sustaining toiled powered by a microwave? Yes.\n\n<blockquote>Preliminary calculations show that microwave plasma gasification may be energy self-sufficient, provided that efficient transformation and high throughput of human waste matter can be obtained. It is also affordable.</blockquote>\n\n','Reinventing the toilet for safe and affordable sanitation',0,'','publish','open','closed','','reinventing-the-toilet-for-safe-and-affordable-sanitation','','','2011-07-19 14:58:56','2011-07-19 21:58:56','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=2610',0,'post','',0),
