	(2616,1,'2011-06-27 16:40:32','2011-06-27 23:40:32','Jason-Preston.com is my personal blog, and it contains a collection of articles I\'ve written and links I\'ve found interesting since 2005. I\'ve always had an interest in technology, startups, and video games, so I\'d expect to find plenty of things in those categories. \r\n\r\n<h3>About Jason:</h3>\r\n\r\n<img src=\"http://www.jason-preston.com/wp-content/uploads/2008/07/jason-bnw-border.gif\" alt=\"jason-bnw-border\" title=\"jason-bnw-border\" width=\"240\" height=\"297\" class=\"alignright size-full wp-image-2055\" /><a name=\"long\"></a>Jason Preston is the Vice President of Strategy and Product Development for the <a href=\"http://parnassusgroup.com\">Parnassus Group</a>, a Redmond-based company that produces conferences and parties around emerging technologies, and provides social media intelligence to clients and partners seeking to effectively participate in online communities. \r\n\r\nJason has worked with clients on shaping blogger engagement strategies, creating blogs, and understanding the business value of social media tools like Twitter and Facebook. He has spoken at numerous local and national conferences including the Web Community Forum, The Tweet House, and Ignite Seattle. He has written about social media and emerging technologies in <a href=\"http://crosscut.com\">Crosscut</a> and <a href=\"http://www.seattlebusinessmonthly.com/\">Seattle Business Magazine</a>.\r\n\r\nIn his spare time, Jason maintains a number of side-projects, the most interesting of which is <a href=\"http://potluks.com\">Potluk</a>, a web service that allows users to create their own personal \"Hacker News\" site - a private or public collection of links that group members can vote and comment on.\r\n\r\nHe graduated from Occidental College in 2007 with a Bachelor\'s degree in Diplomacy and World Affairs, which is a fancy way of saying \"Economics, Business, Politics, and Philosophy.\"\r\n\r\n<a name=\"short\"></a>\r\n<h3>Shorter Bio</h3>\r\n\r\nJason Preston is the Vice President of Strategy and Product Development at the Parnassus Group, a social media intelligence and events production company based in Redmond. Jason has spoken at numerous local and national conferences including the Web Community Forum, The Tweet House, and Ignite Seattle. He has written about social media and emerging technologies in <a href=\"http://crosscut.com\">Crosscut</a> and <a href=\"http://www.seattlebusinessmonthly.com/\">Seattle Business Magazine</a>.\r\n\r\nIn his spare time, Jason maintains a number of side-projects, the most interesting of which is <a href=\"http://potluks.com\">Potluk</a>, a web service that allows users to create their own personal \"Hacker News\" site - a private or public collection of links that group members can vote and comment on.\r\n\r\n<h3>Speaking</h3>\r\n\r\n<strong>Jason Preston</strong> is an accomplished public speaker and a recognized expert in social media living in Seattle, washington with his wife <a href=\"http://moniguzman.com\">Mónica Guzmán Preston</a>. \r\n\r\nHe has presented for the Tweet House, the Web Community Forum, the Redmond Chamber of Commerce, the Greater Seattle Chamber of Commerce, SCORE, the Social Networking for Business Conference, Ignite Seattle, 140 | The Twitter Conference, and others.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re interested in having Jason speak at your event, please <a href=\"mailto:jason@prestons.me\">contact him</a> via e-mail. \r\n\r\n\r\n<strong>Video of Jason\'s work:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n        <li>The Twitter Conference: <a href=\"http://vimeo.com/7148408\">The Comedy Session - Being Funny, In Short</a></li>\r\n	<li>Ignite Seattle: <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dTY9PjrFOhA\">How to Say Anything in 140 Characters or Less</a></li>\r\n	<li>Seattle Chamber: <a href=\"http://vimeo.com/3442553\">Buzz Monitoring in Social Media</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Other fun stuff</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>It was great fun to<a href=\"http://www.geekwire.com/2011/rewind-facebook-twitter-social-media-power-users\"> join the GeekWire podcast</a> as a guest alongside @moniguzman in early June. We chatted about Twitter, mostly, and living the digital live at home.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n','About',0,'','inherit','open','closed','','1810-revision-34','','','2011-06-27 16:40:32','2011-06-27 23:40:32','',1810,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2011/06/27/1810-revision-34/',0,'revision','',0),
	(2617,1,'2011-08-17 13:54:54','2011-08-17 20:54:54','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://www.charleshooper.net/blog/stop-letting-tech-people-be-socially-inept/\">Stop Letting Technical People Get Away With Social Ineptitude - Charles Hooper | Charles Hooper</a></div>\n\nI think that\'s a great ultimate goal, but I also think that so long as really talented developers (technical people) are hard to find, and so long as they want to get away with being socially inept, they will get away with it. \n\nBut if you are a technical person who wants to <em>really stand out</em>, be a person with <a href=\"http://dcortesi.com/\">social</a> <a href=\"http://twitter.com/#!/aviel\">skills</a>. \n\n','Stop Letting Technical People Get Away With Social Ineptitude',0,'','publish','open','closed','','stop-letting-technical-people-get-away-with-social-ineptitude','','\nhttp://www.charleshooper.net/blog/stop-letting-tech-people-be-socially-inept/','2011-08-17 13:54:56','2011-08-17 20:54:56','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=2617',0,'post','',0),
	(2618,1,'2011-08-17 13:54:54','2011-08-17 20:54:54','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://www.charleshooper.net/blog/stop-letting-tech-people-be-socially-inept/\">Stop Letting Technical People Get Away With Social Ineptitude - Charles Hooper | Charles Hooper</a></div>\n\nI think that\'s a great ultimate goal, but I also think that so long as really talented developers (technical people) are hard to find, and so long as they want to get away with being socially inept, they will get away with it. \n\nBut if you are a technical person who wants to <em>really stand out</em>, be a person with <a href=\"http://dcortesi.com/\">social</a> <a href=\"http://twitter.com/#!/aviel\">skills</a>. \n\n','Stop Letting Technical People Get Away With Social Ineptitude',0,'','inherit','open','closed','','2617-revision','','','2011-08-17 13:54:54','2011-08-17 20:54:54','',2617,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2011/08/17/2617-revision/',0,'revision','',0),
	(2619,1,'2008-03-02 20:54:12','2008-03-03 03:54:12','As an avid gamer, and someone who plans to spend time working in the videogames industry, I often find myself having to defend videogames as an art form, as an industry, and as a pastime. \r\n\r\nAside from the usual concerns about throwing my life away on something that isn\'t a \"serious pursuit,\" many people are rightfully concerned about the affect that violence in videogames can have on children (nobody\'s really concerned about what affects it can have on teens and adults, but we should probably be curious about that, too). \r\n\r\nThere is no cut and dry answer to the question, and as such, there aren\'t very many reliable resources where people who aren\'t familiar with videogames can find out about the risks and learn about what they should','The effects of videogame violence',0,'','inherit','open','closed','','1702-revision','','','2008-03-02 20:54:12','2008-03-03 03:54:12','',1702,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2008/03/02/1702-revision/',0,'revision','',0),
	(2622,1,'2011-08-17 15:53:18','2011-08-17 22:53:18','','I Can Build Your Web Site',0,'','inherit','open','closed','','1702-revision-3','','','2011-08-17 15:53:18','2011-08-17 22:53:18','',1702,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2011/08/17/1702-revision-3/',0,'revision','',0),
	(2623,1,'2011-08-17 22:46:20','2011-08-18 05:46:20','Every business needs a web site. \r\n\r\nIf you\'re a consultant, if you\'re a massage parlor, if you\'re a real estate developer. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nMaintaining a traditional business web site is hard. \r\n\r\n<strong>Web Sites I Have Built</strong> (in addition to this one)\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Tweet House</li>\r\n<li>UIG Applied Energetics</li>\r\n<li>L33tsauce</li>\r\n</ul>','I Can Build Your Web Site',0,'','inherit','open','closed','','1702-revision-4','','','2011-08-17 22:46:20','2011-08-18 05:46:20','',1702,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2011/08/17/1702-revision-4/',0,'revision','',0),
	(2624,1,'2011-08-18 00:04:52','2011-08-18 07:04:52','Like a brick & mortar storefront, your web site is your face to the public. Practically every purchase, whether it\'s retail, business to business, or service based, is researched online before it is completed. Which means that no matter what your business is, your presence on the web is critical to your success. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<strong>Web Sites I Have Built</strong> (in addition to this one)\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://tweet-house.com\">Tweet House</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://parnassusgroup.com\">Parnassus Group</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://uigappliedenergetics.com\">UIG Applied Energetics</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://l33tsauce.com\">L33tsauce</a></li>\r\n</ul>','I Can Build Your Web Site',0,'','inherit','open','closed','','1702-revision-5','','','2011-08-18 00:04:52','2011-08-18 07:04:52','',1702,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2011/08/18/1702-revision-5/',0,'revision','',0),
	(2625,1,'2011-08-18 00:16:36','2011-08-18 07:16:36','Like a brick & mortar storefront, your web site is your face to the public. Practically every purchase, whether it\'s retail, business to business, or service based, is researched online before it is completed. Which means that no matter what your business is, your presence on the web is critical to your success. \r\n\r\nI have built websites on multiple platforms for eight years. \r\n\r\n<strong>They way it works:</strong>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>I meet with you or talk to you on the phone about your business and your goals for your web site.</li>\r\n<li>Based on your goals we set out a plan and a price for the project.</li>\r\n<li>If you have a mockup or design for me to build to, you deliver that to me.</li>\r\n<li>You provide the copy and images to be used in your site. If you need me to write the copy or produce the imagery, that will be built into the cost of the project.</li>\r\n<li>I will build out a prototype of the site and submit it for your feedback.</li>\r\n<li>Based on your feedback I modify the site.</li>\r\n<li>Once the site is ready to go, I\'ll teach you how to get in to the back end and make your own changes so you don\'t need a webmaster.</li>\r\n<li>I\'ll upload the site to the hosting you prefer, and configure it to work with your domain.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<strong>Web Sites I Have Built</strong> (in addition to this one)\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://tweet-house.com\">Tweet House</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://parnassusgroup.com\">Parnassus Group</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://uigappliedenergetics.com\">UIG Applied Energetics</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://l33tsauce.com\">L33tsauce</a></li>\r\n</ul>','I Can Build Your Web Site',0,'','inherit','open','closed','','1702-revision-6','','','2011-08-18 00:16:36','2011-08-18 07:16:36','',1702,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2011/08/18/1702-revision-6/',0,'revision','',0),
	(2626,1,'2011-08-18 00:19:57','2011-08-18 07:19:57','Like a brick & mortar storefront, your web site is your face to the public. Practically every purchase, whether it\'s retail, business to business, or service based, is researched online before it is completed. Which means that no matter what your business is, your presence on the web is critical to your success. \r\n\r\nI have built websites on multiple platforms for eight years. \r\n\r\n<strong>They way it works:</strong>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>I meet with you or talk to you on the phone about your business and your goals for your web site.</li>\r\n<li>Based on your goals we set out a plan and a price for the project.</li>\r\n<li>If you have a mockup or design for me to build to, you deliver that to me.</li>\r\n<li>You provide the copy and images to be used in your site. If you need me to write the copy or produce the imagery, that will be built into the cost of the project.</li>\r\n<li>I will build out a prototype of the site and submit it for your feedback.</li>\r\n<li>Based on your feedback I modify the site.</li>\r\n<li>Once the site is ready to go, I\'ll teach you how to get in to the back end and make your own changes so you don\'t need a webmaster.</li>\r\n<li>I\'ll upload the site to the hosting you prefer, and configure it to work with your domain.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<strong>Web Sites I Have Built</strong> (in addition to this one)\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://tweet-house.com\">Tweet House</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://parnassusgroup.com\">Parnassus Group</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://uigappliedenergetics.com\">UIG Applied Energetics</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://l33tsauce.com\">L33tsauce</a></li>\r\n</ul>','I Can Build Your Web Site',0,'','inherit','open','closed','','1702-revision-7','','','2011-08-18 00:19:57','2011-08-18 07:19:57','',1702,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2011/08/18/1702-revision-7/',0,'revision','',0);
