djust your approach accordingly. ','Big events vs little events',0,'','inherit','open','closed','','2637-revision','','','2011-09-09 11:22:56','2011-09-09 18:22:56','',2637,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2011/09/09/2637-revision/',0,'revision','',0),
	(2639,1,'2011-09-13 14:27:48','2011-09-13 21:27:48','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://blog.jgc.org/2009/08/please-dont-use-pie-charts.html\">Please don\'t use pie charts</a></div>\n\nOften the first sign of a report prepared by someone who doesn\'t know how to prepare reports. \n\n','Please don\'t use pie charts',0,'','publish','open','closed','','please-dont-use-pie-charts','','','2011-09-13 14:27:50','2011-09-13 21:27:50','',0,'http://www.jason-preston.com/?p=2639',0,'post','',2),
