	(2643,1,'2011-10-01 13:29:03','2011-10-01 20:29:03','<div class=\"ll\"><a href=\"http://uncrunched.com/2011/10/01/brutal-honesty/\">Arrington on Brutal Honesty</a></div>\n\nArrington quotes Vinod Khosla on brutal honesty, and agrees with it:\n\n<blockquote>“We prefer brutal honesty to hypocritical politeness.”</blockquote>\n\nI know I\'m not along in admiring Arrington for his directness, but it seems to me like the ability to be brutally honest is a luxury you have to earn by getting to a place where you do not need people to like you. \n\n\n','Arrington on Brutal Honesty ',0,'','inherit','open','closed','','2642-revision','','','2011-10-01 13:29:03','2011-10-01 20:29:03','',2642,'http://www.jason-preston.com/index.php/2011/10/01/2642-revision/',0,'revision','',0),
